window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/courses/a486-43dde79fa3ffa62c.json"]={sha256:"43dde79fa3ffa62c42eb46ad1727274607fdf325dd282d23cd78c492dab3ed54",value:{"id":"a486","title":"台灣同步輻射光源 TLS","titleEn":"Taiwan Light Source","category":"instruments","kind":"course","status":"guided","contentStatus":"reviewable-educational-curriculum","summary":"以 TLS 的 18 台偶極（ρ = 3.495 m）與 1.3 → 1.5 GeV 的能量提升為起點，理解這座亞洲第一座第三代光源如何用 6 T 超導波長位移器與超導扭擺器把 1.5 GeV 環推向硬 X 光，再把 CESR 型超導射頻、每 60 s 的頂注、TPS 施工期間的地層監測與軟 X 光波盪器整合成與 TPS 並行運轉的工程交接。","summaryEn":"Starting from TLS's 18 dipoles (ρ = 3.495 m) and its 1.3 → 1.5 GeV energy upgrade, see how Asia's first third-generation source used a 6 T superconducting wavelength shifter and superconducting wigglers to push a 1.5 GeV ring into hard X-rays, then integrate the CESR-type SRF cavity, 60 s top-up, ground monitoring during TPS construction and soft-X-ray undulators into a handoff for operation alongside TPS.","scope":"依公開物理原理與官方資料編寫的原創教學；步驟是可驗證的學習任務與假想算例，不是原廠配方、施工圖、設備操作許可或安全程序。數值均為教學假設，需依實際規格重算。","scopeEn":"Original teaching built from public physics and official sources. Steps are verifiable learning tasks and hypothetical exercises, not vendor recipes, construction drawings, operating authorisation or safety procedures. Numbers are teaching assumptions and must be recalculated for real specifications.","subcategory":"optics-facilities-accelerators","subcategoryTitle":"大型加速器與光源設施","subcategoryTitleEn":"Large accelerator and light-source facilities","learningTrack":"optics","learningSubdiscipline":"optics-facilities-accelerators","learningTags":["optics","optics-facilities-accelerators","accelerator"],"architectureFamily":"accelerator","architectureNodes":[["直線加速器與 1.5 GeV 增能環","Linac and 1.5 GeV booster"],["6 重對稱 TBA 儲存環","Six-fold TBA storage ring"],["CESR 型超導射頻腔","CESR-type SRF cavity"],["超導扭擺器與波長位移器","Superconducting wigglers and wavelength shifter"],["HLS 地層與軌道監測","HLS ground and orbit monitoring"],["軟 X 光與硬 X 光光束線","Soft- and hard-X-ray beamlines"]],"architectureEdges":[[0,1],[2,1],[3,1],[4,1],[1,5],[3,5]],"diagram":{"type":"accelerator","labels":["直線加速器與 1.5 GeV 增能環","6 重對稱 TBA 儲存環","CESR 型超導射頻腔","超導扭擺器與波長位移器","HLS 地層與軌道監測"],"labelsEn":["Linac and 1.5 GeV booster","Six-fold TBA storage ring","CESR-type SRF cavity","Superconducting wigglers and wavelength shifter","HLS ground and orbit monitoring"],"original":true,"notToScale":true},"workedExample":{"title":"原創假想算例與邊界","titleEn":"Original hypothetical example and boundaries","text":"能量提升練習：TLS 由 1.3 GeV 提升到 1.5 GeV（ρ = 3.495 m 不變）。B 由 1.24 T 升到 1.43 T；E_c = 2.218E³/ρ 由 1.39 keV 升到 2.14 keV；U₀ = 88.46E⁴/ρ 由 72 keV 升到 128 keV，300 mA 時偶極輻射功率由 21.7 kW 升到 38.4 kW。8 keV 光子的偶極通量 dN/dθ = 2.457×10¹³·E·I·G₁(y)（photons/s/mrad/0.1%BW），y = 8/E_c：1.3 GeV 時 y = 5.74、G₁ ≈ 0.0108，通量 ≈ 1.0×10¹¹；1.5 GeV 時 y = 3.74、G₁ ≈ 0.0670，通量 ≈ 7.4×10¹¹，能量只提高 15%，8 keV 通量卻提高約 7.2 倍。代價是發射度按 E² 由 19.2 增為 25.6 nm·rad，而水平阻尼時間 τ_x = 2ET₀/U₀ 由 14.4 ms 縮短為 9.4 ms。數值依公開參數與教學假設計算，不代表實際運轉紀錄。","textEn":"Energy-upgrade exercise: TLS goes from 1.3 GeV to 1.5 GeV with ρ = 3.495 m unchanged. B rises from 1.24 T to 1.43 T; E_c = 2.218E³/ρ from 1.39 keV to 2.14 keV; U₀ = 88.46E⁴/ρ from 72 keV to 128 keV, so dipole radiation at 300 mA grows from 21.7 kW to 38.4 kW. Bending-magnet flux at 8 keV is dN/dθ = 2.457×10¹³·E·I·G₁(y) photons/s/mrad/0.1%BW with y = 8/E_c: at 1.3 GeV, y = 5.74, G₁ ≈ 0.0108 and the flux ≈ 1.0×10¹¹; at 1.5 GeV, y = 3.74, G₁ ≈ 0.0670 and the flux ≈ 7.4×10¹¹, so a 15% energy increase raises 8 keV flux about 7.2 times. The price is emittance growing as E² from 19.2 to 25.6 nm·rad, while the horizontal damping time τ_x = 2ET₀/U₀ shortens from 14.4 ms to 9.4 ms. Numbers follow public parameters and teaching assumptions, not operating records.","assumptions":"數值是本課自行設定的教學假設，不代表實機量測、產品額定或操作參數；改變系統邊界後必須重算。","assumptionsEn":"Inputs are teaching assumptions, not measured hardware, product ratings or operating parameters; recalculate after changing the system boundary.","sourceScope":"原創數值練習；來源支援公開原理與設施背景，不宣稱來源提供這組數據。","sourceScopeEn":"Original numerical exercise; sources support public principles and facility context, not these numbers."},"depth":4,"languageCoverage":["zh-TW","en"],"simulationOnly":true,"educationEdition":12,"enrichmentVersion":12,"stages":[{"id":"a486-v12-s1","title":"系統邊界與物理原理","titleEn":"System boundaries and physical principles","description":"本階段聚焦「1.5 GeV 偶極輻射與能量提升」與「TBA 發射度與 TPS 的世代比較」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"1.5 GeV dipole radiation and the energy upgrade\" and \"TBA emittance and the generational comparison with TPS\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a486-v12-01","title":"1.5 GeV 偶極輻射與能量提升：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"1.5 GeV dipole radiation and the energy upgrade: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"],"prerequisiteIds":[],"objective":"說明「18 台偶極磁鐵（ρ = 3.495 m）」如何決定台灣同步輻射光源 TLS的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “18 dipoles with ρ = 3.495 m” determines the key performance of “Taiwan Light Source”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"TLS 是周長 120 m 的電子儲存環，由 6 個三彎消色散（TBA）超週期、共 18 台偶極磁鐵組成，彎轉半徑 3.495 m。它原本以 1.3 GeV、1.24 T 設計並於 1993 年啟用，1996 年起把運轉能量提升到 1.5 GeV；由於 ρ 固定，偶極場必須按比例升到約 1.43 T，鐵芯更接近飽和。能量提升使臨界能量按 E³ 上升、每圈輻射損失按 E⁴ 上升，光譜往較硬的 X 光延伸，代價是射頻功率與真空熱負載同步增加。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「18 台偶極磁鐵（ρ = 3.495 m）」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"TLS is an electron storage ring of 120 m circumference built from six triple-bend-achromat (TBA) superperiods with 18 dipoles of 3.495 m bending radius. Designed for 1.3 GeV at 1.24 T and opened in 1993, it moved to 1.5 GeV operation from 1996; with ρ fixed, the dipole field had to rise proportionally to about 1.43 T, closer to iron saturation. The upgrade raises the critical energy as E³ and the energy loss per turn as E⁴, extending the spectrum to harder X-rays at the price of more RF power and vacuum heat load. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “18 dipoles with ρ = 3.495 m”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：能量提升時磁場、臨界能量與每圈損失的連鎖變化：Bρ = 3.3356×1.5 = 5.003 T·m，B = 5.003/3.495 ≈ 1.43 T（1.3 GeV 時 1.24 T）。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Chain of changes with energy: Bρ = 3.3356×1.5 = 5.003 T·m and B = 5.003/3.495 ≈ 1.43 T (1.24 T at 1.3 GeV).","failure":"常見誤解：「能量只提高 15%，同步輻射功率也只增加約 15%。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Raising energy by 15% raises synchrotron-radiation power by only about 15%.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「18 台偶極磁鐵（ρ = 3.495 m）」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “18 dipoles with ρ = 3.495 m”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a486-v12-01-k1","title":"1.5 GeV 偶極輻射與能量提升","titleEn":"1.5 GeV dipole radiation and the energy upgrade","text":"TLS 是周長 120 m 的電子儲存環，由 6 個三彎消色散（TBA）超週期、共 18 台偶極磁鐵組成，彎轉半徑 3.495 m。它原本以 1.3 GeV、1.24 T 設計並於 1993 年啟用，1996 年起把運轉能量提升到 1.5 GeV；由於 ρ 固定，偶極場必須按比例升到約 1.43 T，鐵芯更接近飽和。","textEn":"TLS is an electron storage ring of 120 m circumference built from six triple-bend-achromat (TBA) superperiods with 18 dipoles of 3.495 m bending radius. Designed for 1.3 GeV at 1.24 T and opened in 1993, it moved to 1.5 GeV operation from 1996; with ρ fixed, the dipole field had to rise proportionally to about 1.43 T, closer to iron saturation.","sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"]},{"id":"a486-v12-01-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：能量只提高 15%，同步輻射功率也只增加約 15%。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Raising energy by 15% raises synchrotron-radiation power by only about 15%. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「1.5 GeV 偶極輻射與能量提升」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"1.5 GeV dipole radiation and the energy upgrade\" is correct?","options":["能量只提高 15%，同步輻射功率也只增加約 15%。","TLS 是周長 120 m 的電子儲存環，由 6 個三彎消色散（TBA）超週期、共 18 台偶極磁鐵組成，彎轉半徑 3.495 m。","能量較低的 TLS，發射度一定比 3 GeV 的 TPS 小。"],"optionsEn":["Raising energy by 15% raises synchrotron-radiation power by only about 15%.","TLS is an electron storage ring of 120 m circumference built from six triple-bend-achromat (TBA) superperiods with 18 dipoles of 3.495 m bending radius.","Because TLS has lower energy, its emittance must be smaller than that of 3 GeV TPS."],"answer":1,"explanation":"TLS 是周長 120 m 的電子儲存環，由 6 個三彎消色散（TBA）超週期、共 18 台偶極磁鐵組成，彎轉半徑 3.495 m。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"TLS is an electron storage ring of 120 m circumference built from six triple-bend-achromat (TBA) superperiods with 18 dipoles of 3.495 m bending radius. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":1},{"id":"a486-v12-02","title":"1.5 GeV 偶極輻射與能量提升：定量估算","titleEn":"1.5 GeV dipole radiation and the energy upgrade: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"],"prerequisiteIds":["a486-v12-01"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「18 台偶極磁鐵（ρ = 3.495 m）」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “18 dipoles with ρ = 3.495 m” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：能量提升時磁場、臨界能量與每圈損失的連鎖變化：Bρ = 3.3356×1.5 = 5.003 T·m，B = 5.003/3.495 ≈ 1.43 T（1.3 GeV 時 1.24 T）。E_c = 2.218E³/ρ ≈ 2.14 keV（1.3 GeV 時 1.39 keV）；U₀ = 88.46E⁴/ρ ≈ 128 keV（1.3 GeV 時 72 keV，增加 77%）；360 mA 時偶極輻射功率 ≈ 128 keV×0.36 A ≈ 46 kW。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Chain of changes with energy: Bρ = 3.3356×1.5 = 5.003 T·m and B = 5.003/3.495 ≈ 1.43 T (1.24 T at 1.3 GeV). E_c = 2.218E³/ρ ≈ 2.14 keV (1.39 keV at 1.3 GeV); U₀ = 88.46E⁴/ρ ≈ 128 keV (72 keV at 1.3 GeV, 77% more); at 360 mA the dipole radiation power is ≈ 128 keV×0.36 A ≈ 46 kW. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：量測射頻前向減反射功率並扣除腔損，與 I×(U₀ + 插件損失) 比較；以偶極光束線單色器掃描光譜，確認高能尾端斜率符合 2.14 keV 臨界能量的通用曲線，間接核對束流能量；以磁場量測確認 1.43 T 運轉點的積分場與多極成分。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Measure RF forward minus reflected power less cavity loss and compare with I×(U₀ + insertion-device loss); scan a bending-magnet beamline spectrum with its monochromator and check that the high-energy tail matches the universal curve for a 2.14 keV critical energy, an indirect check of beam energy; confirm integrated field and multipoles at the 1.43 T operating point by magnetic measurement.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a486-v12-02-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"能量提升時磁場、臨界能量與每圈損失的連鎖變化：Bρ = 3.3356×1.5 = 5.003 T·m，B = 5.003/3.495 ≈ 1.43 T（1.3 GeV 時 1.24 T）。E_c = 2.218E³/ρ ≈ 2.14 keV（1.3 GeV 時 1.39 keV）；U₀ = 88.46E⁴/ρ ≈ 128 keV（1.3 GeV 時 72 keV，增加 77%）；360 mA 時偶極輻射功率 ≈ 128 keV×0.36 A ≈ 46 kW。","textEn":"Chain of changes with energy: Bρ = 3.3356×1.5 = 5.003 T·m and B = 5.003/3.495 ≈ 1.43 T (1.24 T at 1.3 GeV). E_c = 2.218E³/ρ ≈ 2.14 keV (1.39 keV at 1.3 GeV); U₀ = 88.46E⁴/ρ ≈ 128 keV (72 keV at 1.3 GeV, 77% more); at 360 mA the dipole radiation power is ≈ 128 keV×0.36 A ≈ 46 kW.","sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"]},{"id":"a486-v12-02-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「1.5 GeV 偶極輻射與能量提升」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"1.5 GeV dipole radiation and the energy upgrade\", which statement holds?","options":["改用超導腔只是為了省電，對束流穩定性沒有幫助。","軌道回授可以補償任何地面變形，因此不必監測地層。","能量提升時磁場、臨界能量與每圈損失的連鎖變化：Bρ = 3.3356×1.5 = 5.003 T·m，B = 5.003/3.495 ≈ 1.43 T（1.3 GeV 時 1.24 T）。"],"optionsEn":["The switch to an SRF cavity was only about saving power, not beam stability.","Orbit feedback compensates any ground motion, so ground monitoring is unnecessary.","Chain of changes with energy: Bρ = 3.3356×1.5 = 5.003 T·m and B = 5.003/3.495 ≈ 1.43 T (1.24 T at 1.3 GeV)."],"answer":2,"explanation":"能量提升時磁場、臨界能量與每圈損失的連鎖變化：Bρ = 3.3356×1.5 = 5.003 T·m，B = 5.003/3.495 ≈ 1.43 T（1.3 GeV 時 1.24 T）。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Chain of changes with energy: Bρ = 3.3356×1.5 = 5.003 T·m and B = 5.003/3.495 ≈ 1.43 T (1.24 T at 1.3 GeV). Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":2},{"id":"a486-v12-03","title":"1.5 GeV 偶極輻射與能量提升：量測與驗證","titleEn":"1.5 GeV dipole radiation and the energy upgrade: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"],"prerequisiteIds":["a486-v12-02"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「18 台偶極磁鐵（ρ = 3.495 m）」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “18 dipoles with ρ = 3.495 m” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"量測射頻前向減反射功率並扣除腔損，與 I×(U₀ + 插件損失) 比較；以偶極光束線單色器掃描光譜，確認高能尾端斜率符合 2.14 keV 臨界能量的通用曲線，間接核對束流能量；以磁場量測確認 1.43 T 運轉點的積分場與多極成分。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Measure RF forward minus reflected power less cavity loss and compare with I×(U₀ + insertion-device loss); scan a bending-magnet beamline spectrum with its monochromator and check that the high-energy tail matches the universal curve for a 2.14 keV critical energy, an indirect check of beam energy; confirm integrated field and multipoles at the 1.43 T operating point by magnetic measurement. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：能量提升後若未重新評估偶極的飽和與多極場，六極成分改變色品與動力孔徑，注入效率與壽命下降；光子吸收器若仍按 1.3 GeV 的熱負載設計，局部過熱造成壓力上升，所有光束線同時受影響。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: If dipole saturation and multipoles are not re-evaluated after the upgrade, a changed sextupole component alters chromaticity and dynamic aperture, lowering injection efficiency and lifetime; photon absorbers still designed for 1.3 GeV heat loads overheat locally, pressure rises and every beamline suffers.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a486-v12-03-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"量測射頻前向減反射功率並扣除腔損，與 I×(U₀ + 插件損失) 比較；以偶極光束線單色器掃描光譜，確認高能尾端斜率符合 2.14 keV 臨界能量的通用曲線，間接核對束流能量；以磁場量測確認 1.43 T 運轉點的積分場與多極成分。","textEn":"Measure RF forward minus reflected power less cavity loss and compare with I×(U₀ + insertion-device loss); scan a bending-magnet beamline spectrum with its monochromator and check that the high-energy tail matches the universal curve for a 2.14 keV critical energy, an indirect check of beam energy; confirm integrated field and multipoles at the 1.43 T operating point by magnetic measurement.","sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"]},{"id":"a486-v12-03-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「1.5 GeV 偶極輻射與能量提升」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"1.5 GeV dipole radiation and the energy upgrade\"?","options":["量測射頻前向減反射功率並扣除腔損，與 I×(U₀ + 插件損失) 比較。","量測時不必記錄溫度、振動與時間等條件，因為它們不會影響結果。","低能量環的波盪器也能輕易產生 10 keV 以上的基頻 X 光。"],"optionsEn":["Measure RF forward minus reflected power less cavity loss and compare with I×(U₀ + insertion-device loss).","Temperature, vibration and timing need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","An undulator on a low-energy ring can just as easily produce a fundamental above 10 keV."],"answer":0,"explanation":"量測射頻前向減反射功率並扣除腔損，與 I×(U₀ + 插件損失) 比較；以偶極光束線單色器掃描光譜，確認高能尾端斜率符合 2.14 keV 臨界能量的通用曲線，間接核對束流能量；以磁場量測確認 1.43 T 運轉點的積分場與多極成分。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Measure RF forward minus reflected power less cavity loss and compare with I×(U₀ + insertion-device loss); scan a bending-magnet beamline spectrum with its monochromator and check that the high-energy tail matches the universal curve for a 2.14 keV critical energy, an indirect check of beam energy; confirm integrated field and multipoles at the 1.43 T operating point by magnetic measurement. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":3},{"id":"a486-v12-04","title":"1.5 GeV 偶極輻射與能量提升：失效診斷","titleEn":"1.5 GeV dipole radiation and the energy upgrade: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"],"prerequisiteIds":["a486-v12-03"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「18 台偶極磁鐵（ρ = 3.495 m）」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “18 dipoles with ρ = 3.495 m” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"能量提升後若未重新評估偶極的飽和與多極場，六極成分改變色品與動力孔徑，注入效率與壽命下降；光子吸收器若仍按 1.3 GeV 的熱負載設計，局部過熱造成壓力上升，所有光束線同時受影響。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"If dipole saturation and multipoles are not re-evaluated after the upgrade, a changed sextupole component alters chromaticity and dynamic aperture, lowering injection efficiency and lifetime; photon absorbers still designed for 1.3 GeV heat loads overheat locally, pressure rises and every beamline suffers. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：能量提升使臨界能量按 E³ 上升、每圈輻射損失按 E⁴ 上升，光譜往較硬的 X 光延伸，代價是射頻功率與真空熱負載同步增加。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The upgrade raises the critical energy as E³ and the energy loss per turn as E⁴, extending the spectrum to harder X-rays at the price of more RF power and vacuum heat load.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「能量只提高 15%，同步輻射功率也只增加約 15%。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Raising energy by 15% raises synchrotron-radiation power by only about 15%.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a486-v12-04-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"能量提升後若未重新評估偶極的飽和與多極場，六極成分改變色品與動力孔徑，注入效率與壽命下降；光子吸收器若仍按 1.3 GeV 的熱負載設計，局部過熱造成壓力上升，所有光束線同時受影響。","textEn":"If dipole saturation and multipoles are not re-evaluated after the upgrade, a changed sextupole component alters chromaticity and dynamic aperture, lowering injection efficiency and lifetime; photon absorbers still designed for 1.3 GeV heat loads overheat locally, pressure rises and every beamline suffers.","sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"]},{"id":"a486-v12-04-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「1.5 GeV 偶極輻射與能量提升」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"1.5 GeV dipole radiation and the energy upgrade\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自操作人員失誤，系統設計不需要檢討。","能量提升後若未重新評估偶極的飽和與多極場，六極成分改變色品與動力孔徑，注入效率與壽命下降。","能量較低的 TLS，發射度一定比 3 GeV 的 TPS 小。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is operator error, so the system design never needs review.","If dipole saturation and multipoles are not re-evaluated after the upgrade, a changed sextupole component alters chromaticity and dynamic aperture, lowering injection efficiency and lifetime.","Because TLS has lower energy, its emittance must be smaller than that of 3 GeV TPS."],"answer":1,"explanation":"能量提升後若未重新評估偶極的飽和與多極場，六極成分改變色品與動力孔徑，注入效率與壽命下降；光子吸收器若仍按 1.3 GeV 的熱負載設計，局部過熱造成壓力上升，所有光束線同時受影響。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"If dipole saturation and multipoles are not re-evaluated after the upgrade, a changed sextupole component alters chromaticity and dynamic aperture, lowering injection efficiency and lifetime; photon absorbers still designed for 1.3 GeV heat loads overheat locally, pressure rises and every beamline suffers. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":4},{"id":"a486-v12-05","title":"TBA 發射度與 TPS 的世代比較：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"TBA emittance and the generational comparison with TPS: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"],"prerequisiteIds":["a486-v12-04"],"objective":"說明「六重對稱 TBA 晶格」如何決定台灣同步輻射光源 TLS的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Six-fold TBA lattice” determines the key performance of “Taiwan Light Source”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"第三代光源的關鍵是用消色散晶格壓低發射度，並把插件磁鐵放在零色散的直線段。TLS 每個超週期用三台偶極，6 段約 6 m 長的直線段供插件、射頻與注入使用；設計發射度在 1.3 GeV 為 19.2 nm·rad，按 E² 標度在 1.5 GeV 約 25.6 nm·rad，公開資料依運轉光學列 22 至 25 nm·rad。發射度隨 γ²θ³ 與晶格因子 F 標度：TLS 每台偶極彎 20°，TPS 每台只彎 7.5° 且能量加倍，兩者的發射度相差約 16 倍。設計工作點 7.18／4.13、動量壓縮因子 6.78×10⁻³。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「六重對稱 TBA 晶格」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"The key to a third-generation source is an achromatic lattice that lowers emittance and places insertion devices in dispersion-free straights. TLS uses three dipoles per superperiod and six straights of about 6 m for insertion devices, RF and injection; the design emittance of 19.2 nm·rad at 1.3 GeV scales as E² to about 25.6 nm·rad at 1.5 GeV, with public values of 22 to 25 nm·rad depending on the operating optics. Emittance scales with γ²θ³ and a lattice factor F: each TLS dipole bends 20° while each TPS dipole bends only 7.5° at twice the energy, and their emittances differ by about 16 times. Design tunes are 7.18/4.13 and the momentum compaction is 6.78×10⁻³. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Six-fold TBA lattice”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：ε = F·C_q·γ²θ³。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: ε = F·C_q·γ²θ³.","failure":"常見誤解：「能量較低的 TLS，發射度一定比 3 GeV 的 TPS 小。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Because TLS has lower energy, its emittance must be smaller than that of 3 GeV TPS.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「六重對稱 TBA 晶格」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Six-fold TBA lattice”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a486-v12-05-k1","title":"TBA 發射度與 TPS 的世代比較","titleEn":"TBA emittance and the generational comparison with TPS","text":"第三代光源的關鍵是用消色散晶格壓低發射度，並把插件磁鐵放在零色散的直線段。TLS 每個超週期用三台偶極，6 段約 6 m 長的直線段供插件、射頻與注入使用；設計發射度在 1.3 GeV 為 19.2 nm·rad，按 E² 標度在 1.5 GeV 約 25.6 nm·rad，公開資料依運轉光學列 22 至 25 nm·rad。","textEn":"The key to a third-generation source is an achromatic lattice that lowers emittance and places insertion devices in dispersion-free straights. TLS uses three dipoles per superperiod and six straights of about 6 m for insertion devices, RF and injection; the design emittance of 19.2 nm·rad at 1.3 GeV scales as E² to about 25.6 nm·rad at 1.5 GeV, with public values of 22 to 25 nm·rad depending on the operating optics.","sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"]},{"id":"a486-v12-05-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：能量較低的 TLS，發射度一定比 3 GeV 的 TPS 小。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Because TLS has lower energy, its emittance must be smaller than that of 3 GeV TPS. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「TBA 發射度與 TPS 的世代比較」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"TBA emittance and the generational comparison with TPS\" is correct?","options":["能量較低的 TLS，發射度一定比 3 GeV 的 TPS 小。","超導扭擺器只是讓光變亮，對儲存環的束流動力學沒有影響。","第三代光源的關鍵是用消色散晶格壓低發射度，並把插件磁鐵放在零色散的直線段。"],"optionsEn":["Because TLS has lower energy, its emittance must be smaller than that of 3 GeV TPS.","A superconducting wiggler only brightens the light and leaves ring beam dynamics untouched.","The key to a third-generation source is an achromatic lattice that lowers emittance and places insertion devices in dispersion-free straights."],"answer":2,"explanation":"第三代光源的關鍵是用消色散晶格壓低發射度，並把插件磁鐵放在零色散的直線段。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"The key to a third-generation source is an achromatic lattice that lowers emittance and places insertion devices in dispersion-free straights. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":5},{"id":"a486-v12-06","title":"TBA 發射度與 TPS 的世代比較：定量估算","titleEn":"TBA emittance and the generational comparison with TPS: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"],"prerequisiteIds":["a486-v12-05"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「六重對稱 TBA 晶格」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Six-fold TBA lattice” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：ε = F·C_q·γ²θ³。γ²θ³ 比（TLS/TPS）= (1.5/3)²×(48/18)³ ≈ 0.25×18.96 ≈ 4.74；實際比 25.6/1.6 = 16，表示 TLS 的晶格因子 F ≈ 0.18、TPS ≈ 0.054，相差約 3.4 倍，其餘差距來自晶格世代而非能量與彎角。以 1.3 GeV 設計值換算：19.2×(1.5/1.3)² ≈ 25.6 nm·rad。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: ε = F·C_q·γ²θ³. The γ²θ³ ratio (TLS/TPS) is (1.5/3)²×(48/18)³ ≈ 0.25×18.96 ≈ 4.74, while the actual ratio is 25.6/1.6 = 16, so TLS has F ≈ 0.18 and TPS F ≈ 0.054, about 3.4 times apart; the remaining gap comes from lattice generation rather than energy and bend angle. Scaling the 1.3 GeV design value: 19.2×(1.5/1.3)² ≈ 25.6 nm·rad. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：以軌道響應矩陣擬合求實際 β 與色散，再用 X 光針孔或可見光干涉儀量束流尺寸，按 ε = (σ² − (D·σ_δ)²)/β 反推並與 25 nm·rad 比較；改變射頻頻率量測軌道對能量的響應，以驗證動量壓縮因子 6.78×10⁻³；量測工作點並與 7.18／4.13 的設計值比較。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Fit the orbit-response matrix for actual beta and dispersion, measure beam size with an X-ray pinhole or visible-light interferometer and invert ε = (σ² − (D·σ_δ)²)/β for comparison with 25 nm·rad; measure the orbit response to RF-frequency steps to verify the 6.78×10⁻³ momentum compaction; measure the tunes against the 7.18/4.13 design.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a486-v12-06-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"ε = F·C_q·γ²θ³。γ²θ³ 比（TLS/TPS）= (1.5/3)²×(48/18)³ ≈ 0.25×18.96 ≈ 4.74；實際比 25.6/1.6 = 16，表示 TLS 的晶格因子 F ≈ 0.18、TPS ≈ 0.054，相差約 3.4 倍，其餘差距來自晶格世代而非能量與彎角。以 1.3 GeV 設計值換算：19.2×(1.5/1.3)² ≈ 25.6 nm·rad。","textEn":"ε = F·C_q·γ²θ³. The γ²θ³ ratio (TLS/TPS) is (1.5/3)²×(48/18)³ ≈ 0.25×18.96 ≈ 4.74, while the actual ratio is 25.6/1.6 = 16, so TLS has F ≈ 0.18 and TPS F ≈ 0.054, about 3.4 times apart; the remaining gap comes from lattice generation rather than energy and bend angle. Scaling the 1.3 GeV design value: 19.2×(1.5/1.3)² ≈ 25.6 nm·rad.","sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"]},{"id":"a486-v12-06-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「TBA 發射度與 TPS 的世代比較」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"TBA emittance and the generational comparison with TPS\", which statement holds?","options":["ε = F·C_q·γ²θ³。","實施頂注以後，束流壽命就不再重要。","低能量環的波盪器也能輕易產生 10 keV 以上的基頻 X 光。"],"optionsEn":["ε = F·C_q·γ²θ³.","With top-up running, beam lifetime no longer matters.","An undulator on a low-energy ring can just as easily produce a fundamental above 10 keV."],"answer":0,"explanation":"ε = F·C_q·γ²θ³。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"ε = F·C_q·γ²θ³. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":6},{"id":"a486-v12-07","title":"TBA 發射度與 TPS 的世代比較：量測與驗證","titleEn":"TBA emittance and the generational comparison with TPS: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"],"prerequisiteIds":["a486-v12-06"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「六重對稱 TBA 晶格」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Six-fold TBA lattice” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"以軌道響應矩陣擬合求實際 β 與色散，再用 X 光針孔或可見光干涉儀量束流尺寸，按 ε = (σ² − (D·σ_δ)²)/β 反推並與 25 nm·rad 比較；改變射頻頻率量測軌道對能量的響應，以驗證動量壓縮因子 6.78×10⁻³；量測工作點並與 7.18／4.13 的設計值比較。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Fit the orbit-response matrix for actual beta and dispersion, measure beam size with an X-ray pinhole or visible-light interferometer and invert ε = (σ² − (D·σ_δ)²)/β for comparison with 25 nm·rad; measure the orbit response to RF-frequency steps to verify the 6.78×10⁻³ momentum compaction; measure the tunes against the 7.18/4.13 design. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：插件磁鐵開啟後的聚焦誤差破壞 TBA 的消色散條件，直線段色散不再為零，有效光源尺寸擴大、亮度下降；若只量水平束流尺寸而不扣除色散項，發射度會被高估並誤導晶格調整方向。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Focusing errors from insertion devices break the TBA achromat condition, dispersion appears in the straights, the effective source grows and brightness falls; measuring horizontal beam size without subtracting the dispersion term overestimates emittance and steers lattice tuning the wrong way.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a486-v12-07-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以軌道響應矩陣擬合求實際 β 與色散，再用 X 光針孔或可見光干涉儀量束流尺寸，按 ε = (σ² − (D·σ_δ)²)/β 反推並與 25 nm·rad 比較；改變射頻頻率量測軌道對能量的響應，以驗證動量壓縮因子 6.78×10⁻³；量測工作點並與 7.18／4.13 的設計值比較。","textEn":"Fit the orbit-response matrix for actual beta and dispersion, measure beam size with an X-ray pinhole or visible-light interferometer and invert ε = (σ² − (D·σ_δ)²)/β for comparison with 25 nm·rad; measure the orbit response to RF-frequency steps to verify the 6.78×10⁻³ momentum compaction; measure the tunes against the 7.18/4.13 design.","sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"]},{"id":"a486-v12-07-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「TBA 發射度與 TPS 的世代比較」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"TBA emittance and the generational comparison with TPS\"?","options":["沿用另一台設備或另一個案例的量測結果，就可視為本系統已完成驗證。","以軌道響應矩陣擬合求實際 β 與色散，再用 X 光針孔或可見光干涉儀量束流尺寸，按 ε = (σ² − (D·σ_δ)²)/β 反推並與 25 nm·rad 比較。","TPS 完工後 TLS 就失去用處，應該立即停機。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another instrument or another case counts as verifying this system.","Fit the orbit-response matrix for actual beta and dispersion, measure beam size with an X-ray pinhole or visible-light interferometer and invert ε = (σ² − (D·σ_δ)²)/β for comparison with 25 nm·rad.","Once TPS operated, TLS became useless and should have shut down at once."],"answer":1,"explanation":"以軌道響應矩陣擬合求實際 β 與色散，再用 X 光針孔或可見光干涉儀量束流尺寸，按 ε = (σ² − (D·σ_δ)²)/β 反推並與 25 nm·rad 比較；改變射頻頻率量測軌道對能量的響應，以驗證動量壓縮因子 6.78×10⁻³；量測工作點並與 7.18／4.13 的設計值比較。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Fit the orbit-response matrix for actual beta and dispersion, measure beam size with an X-ray pinhole or visible-light interferometer and invert ε = (σ² − (D·σ_δ)²)/β for comparison with 25 nm·rad; measure the orbit response to RF-frequency steps to verify the 6.78×10⁻³ momentum compaction; measure the tunes against the 7.18/4.13 design. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":7},{"id":"a486-v12-08","title":"TBA 發射度與 TPS 的世代比較：失效診斷","titleEn":"TBA emittance and the generational comparison with TPS: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"],"prerequisiteIds":["a486-v12-07"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「六重對稱 TBA 晶格」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Six-fold TBA lattice” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"插件磁鐵開啟後的聚焦誤差破壞 TBA 的消色散條件，直線段色散不再為零，有效光源尺寸擴大、亮度下降；若只量水平束流尺寸而不扣除色散項，發射度會被高估並誤導晶格調整方向。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Focusing errors from insertion devices break the TBA achromat condition, dispersion appears in the straights, the effective source grows and brightness falls; measuring horizontal beam size without subtracting the dispersion term overestimates emittance and steers lattice tuning the wrong way. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：設計工作點 7.18／4.13、動量壓縮因子 6.78×10⁻³。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Design tunes are 7.18/4.13 and the momentum compaction is 6.78×10⁻³.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「能量較低的 TLS，發射度一定比 3 GeV 的 TPS 小。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Because TLS has lower energy, its emittance must be smaller than that of 3 GeV TPS.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a486-v12-08-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"插件磁鐵開啟後的聚焦誤差破壞 TBA 的消色散條件，直線段色散不再為零，有效光源尺寸擴大、亮度下降；若只量水平束流尺寸而不扣除色散項，發射度會被高估並誤導晶格調整方向。","textEn":"Focusing errors from insertion devices break the TBA achromat condition, dispersion appears in the straights, the effective source grows and brightness falls; measuring horizontal beam size without subtracting the dispersion term overestimates emittance and steers lattice tuning the wrong way.","sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"]},{"id":"a486-v12-08-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「TBA 發射度與 TPS 的世代比較」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"TBA emittance and the generational comparison with TPS\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["調高增益或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數異常。","超導扭擺器只是讓光變亮，對儲存環的束流動力學沒有影響。","插件磁鐵開啟後的聚焦誤差破壞 TBA 的消色散條件，直線段色散不再為零，有效光源尺寸擴大、亮度下降。"],"optionsEn":["Raising the gain or widening the acceptance limits solves most anomalies.","A superconducting wiggler only brightens the light and leaves ring beam dynamics untouched.","Focusing errors from insertion devices break the TBA achromat condition, dispersion appears in the straights, the effective source grows and brightness falls."],"answer":2,"explanation":"插件磁鐵開啟後的聚焦誤差破壞 TBA 的消色散條件，直線段色散不再為零，有效光源尺寸擴大、亮度下降；若只量水平束流尺寸而不扣除色散項，發射度會被高估並誤導晶格調整方向。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Focusing errors from insertion devices break the TBA achromat condition, dispersion appears in the straights, the effective source grows and brightness falls; measuring horizontal beam size without subtracting the dispersion term overestimates emittance and steers lattice tuning the wrong way. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":8}],"order":1},{"id":"a486-v12-s2","title":"元件、材料與製造","titleEn":"Components, materials and fabrication","description":"本階段聚焦「超導插件：把 1.5 GeV 環推向硬 X 光」與「超導射頻升級、高次模與束流負載」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Superconducting insertion devices push a 1.5 GeV ring to hard X-rays\" and \"SRF upgrade, higher-order modes and beam loading\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a486-v12-09","title":"超導插件：把 1.5 GeV 環推向硬 X 光：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Superconducting insertion devices push a 1.5 GeV ring to hard X-rays: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"],"prerequisiteIds":["a486-v12-08"],"objective":"說明「6 T 超導波長位移器與超導扭擺器」如何決定台灣同步輻射光源 TLS的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “6 T wavelength shifter and superconducting wigglers” determines the key performance of “Taiwan Light Source”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"1.5 GeV 環的偶極臨界能量只有 2.14 keV，硬 X 光通量不足；TLS 的解法是局部提高磁場：2002 年起運轉的 6 T 超導波長位移器（SWLS）、3.2 T 的 SW6 超導扭擺器，以及安裝在消色散段內、不佔用直線段的 3.1 T 超導扭擺器 IASW（週期 61 mm、16 極、長 960 mm、極間隙 19 mm）。臨界能量正比於 E²B，6 T 磁場把同一環的臨界能量提高約 4 倍。這些插件浸在 4.5 K 液氦中，啟用時需以四極補償工作點偏移，並評估它們對發射度與能量分散的影響。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「6 T 超導波長位移器與超導扭擺器」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"A 1.5 GeV ring's dipoles give a critical energy of only 2.14 keV and little hard-X-ray flux; TLS raised the field locally instead: a 6 T superconducting wavelength shifter (SWLS) operating since 2002, the 3.2 T SW6 superconducting wiggler, and the 3.1 T in-achromat superconducting wiggler IASW (61 mm period, 16 poles, 960 mm long, 19 mm pole gap), which sits inside the achromat without using a straight. Critical energy scales as E²B, so 6 T raises it about fourfold on the same ring. These devices are immersed in 4.5 K liquid helium, and switching them on requires quadrupole compensation of the tune shift and assessment of their effect on emittance and energy spread. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “6 T wavelength shifter and superconducting wigglers”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：插件磁鐵的臨界能量與磁場成正比，E_c[keV] = 0.665E²B：SWLS 6 T → 0.665×2.25×6 ≈ 8.98 keV；SW6 3.2 T → 4.79 keV；IASW 3.1 T → 4.64 keV。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: An insertion device's critical energy is proportional to its field, E_c[keV] = 0.665E²B: the 6 T SWLS gives 0.665×2.25×6 ≈ 8.98 keV, the 3.2 T SW6 4.79 keV and the 3.1 T IASW 4.64 keV.","failure":"常見誤解：「超導扭擺器只是讓光變亮，對儲存環的束流動力學沒有影響。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A superconducting wiggler only brightens the light and leaves ring beam dynamics untouched.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「6 T 超導波長位移器與超導扭擺器」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “6 T wavelength shifter and superconducting wigglers”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a486-v12-09-k1","title":"超導插件：把 1.5 GeV 環推向硬 X 光","titleEn":"Superconducting insertion devices push a 1.5 GeV ring to hard X-rays","text":"1.5 GeV 環的偶極臨界能量只有 2.14 keV，硬 X 光通量不足；TLS 的解法是局部提高磁場：2002 年起運轉的 6 T 超導波長位移器（SWLS）、3.2 T 的 SW6 超導扭擺器，以及安裝在消色散段內、不佔用直線段的 3.1 T 超導扭擺器 IASW（週期 61 mm、16 極、長 960 mm、極間隙 19 mm）。臨界能量正比於 E²B，6 T 磁場把同一環的臨界能量提高約 4 倍。","textEn":"A 1.5 GeV ring's dipoles give a critical energy of only 2.14 keV and little hard-X-ray flux; TLS raised the field locally instead: a 6 T superconducting wavelength shifter (SWLS) operating since 2002, the 3.2 T SW6 superconducting wiggler, and the 3.1 T in-achromat superconducting wiggler IASW (61 mm period, 16 poles, 960 mm long, 19 mm pole gap), which sits inside the achromat without using a straight. Critical energy scales as E²B, so 6 T raises it about fourfold on the same ring.","sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"]},{"id":"a486-v12-09-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：超導扭擺器只是讓光變亮，對儲存環的束流動力學沒有影響。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A superconducting wiggler only brightens the light and leaves ring beam dynamics untouched. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「超導插件：把 1.5 GeV 環推向硬 X 光」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Superconducting insertion devices push a 1.5 GeV ring to hard X-rays\" is correct?","options":["1.5 GeV 環的偶極臨界能量只有 2.14 keV，硬 X 光通量不足。","超導扭擺器只是讓光變亮，對儲存環的束流動力學沒有影響。","改用超導腔只是為了省電，對束流穩定性沒有幫助。"],"optionsEn":["A 1.5 GeV ring's dipoles give a critical energy of only 2.14 keV and little hard-X-ray flux.","A superconducting wiggler only brightens the light and leaves ring beam dynamics untouched.","The switch to an SRF cavity was only about saving power, not beam stability."],"answer":0,"explanation":"1.5 GeV 環的偶極臨界能量只有 2.14 keV，硬 X 光通量不足；TLS 的解法是局部提高磁場：2002 年起運轉的 6 T 超導波長位移器（SWLS）、3.2 T 的 SW6 超導扭擺器，以及安裝在消色散段內、不佔用直線段的 3.1 T 超導扭擺器 IASW（週期 61 mm、16 極、長 960 mm、極間隙 19 mm）。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"A 1.5 GeV ring's dipoles give a critical energy of only 2.14 keV and little hard-X-ray flux; TLS raised the field locally instead: a 6 T superconducting wavelength shifter (SWLS) operating since 2002, the 3.2 T SW6 superconducting wiggler, and the 3.1 T in-achromat superconducting wiggler IASW (61 mm period, 16 poles, 960 mm long, 19 mm pole gap), which sits inside the achromat without using a straight. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":9},{"id":"a486-v12-10","title":"超導插件：把 1.5 GeV 環推向硬 X 光：定量估算","titleEn":"Superconducting insertion devices push a 1.5 GeV ring to hard X-rays: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"],"prerequisiteIds":["a486-v12-09"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「6 T 超導波長位移器與超導扭擺器」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “6 T wavelength shifter and superconducting wigglers” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：插件磁鐵的臨界能量與磁場成正比，E_c[keV] = 0.665E²B：SWLS 6 T → 0.665×2.25×6 ≈ 8.98 keV；SW6 3.2 T → 4.79 keV；IASW 3.1 T → 4.64 keV。IASW 每圈額外損失 ΔU = 0.633E²⟨B²⟩L = 0.633×2.25×(3.1²/2)×0.96 ≈ 6.57 keV，300 mA 時功率 ≈ 1.97 kW；K = 0.934×3.1×6.1 ≈ 17.7，水平扇角 ±K/γ = ±17.7/2935 ≈ ±6.0 mrad。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: An insertion device's critical energy is proportional to its field, E_c[keV] = 0.665E²B: the 6 T SWLS gives 0.665×2.25×6 ≈ 8.98 keV, the 3.2 T SW6 4.79 keV and the 3.1 T IASW 4.64 keV. The IASW adds ΔU = 0.633E²⟨B²⟩L = 0.633×2.25×(3.1²/2)×0.96 ≈ 6.57 keV per turn, about 1.97 kW at 300 mA; K = 0.934×3.1×6.1 ≈ 17.7, and the horizontal fan is ±K/γ = ±17.7/2935 ≈ ±6.0 mrad. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：IASW 勵磁斜坡時同步記錄工作點與軌道，確認四極補償表把工作點偏移壓回；量測扭擺器光束線在 5 至 23 keV 的通量並與偶極比較（文獻報告 15 keV 約為偶極的 500 倍）；監測液氦消耗（約 2.5 L/h）、真空與失超紀錄，作為低溫負載的驗收依據。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Log tunes and orbit while ramping the IASW to confirm that the quadrupole compensation table restores the tunes; measure wiggler-beamline flux from 5 to 23 keV against a bending magnet (about 500 times at 15 keV was reported); monitor liquid-helium consumption (about 2.5 L/h), vacuum and quench records as the cryogenic-load acceptance.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a486-v12-10-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"插件磁鐵的臨界能量與磁場成正比，E_c[keV] = 0.665E²B：SWLS 6 T → 0.665×2.25×6 ≈ 8.98 keV；SW6 3.2 T → 4.79 keV；IASW 3.1 T → 4.64 keV。IASW 每圈額外損失 ΔU = 0.633E²⟨B²⟩L = 0.633×2.25×(3.1²/2)×0.96 ≈ 6.57 keV，300 mA 時功率 ≈ 1.97 kW；K = 0.934×3.1×6.1 ≈ 17.7，水平扇角 ±K/γ = ±17.7/2935 ≈ ±6.0 mrad。","textEn":"An insertion device's critical energy is proportional to its field, E_c[keV] = 0.665E²B: the 6 T SWLS gives 0.665×2.25×6 ≈ 8.98 keV, the 3.2 T SW6 4.79 keV and the 3.1 T IASW 4.64 keV. The IASW adds ΔU = 0.633E²⟨B²⟩L = 0.633×2.25×(3.1²/2)×0.96 ≈ 6.57 keV per turn, about 1.97 kW at 300 mA; K = 0.934×3.1×6.1 ≈ 17.7, and the horizontal fan is ±K/γ = ±17.7/2935 ≈ ±6.0 mrad.","sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"]},{"id":"a486-v12-10-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「超導插件：把 1.5 GeV 環推向硬 X 光」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Superconducting insertion devices push a 1.5 GeV ring to hard X-rays\", which statement holds?","options":["軌道回授可以補償任何地面變形，因此不必監測地層。","插件磁鐵的臨界能量與磁場成正比，E_c[keV] = 0.665E²B：SWLS 6 T → 0.665×2.25×6 ≈ 8.98 keV。","TPS 完工後 TLS 就失去用處，應該立即停機。"],"optionsEn":["Orbit feedback compensates any ground motion, so ground monitoring is unnecessary.","An insertion device's critical energy is proportional to its field, E_c[keV] = 0.665E²B: the 6 T SWLS gives 0.665×2.25×6 ≈ 8.98 keV, the 3.2 T SW6 4.79 keV and the 3.1 T IASW 4.64 keV.","Once TPS operated, TLS became useless and should have shut down at once."],"answer":1,"explanation":"插件磁鐵的臨界能量與磁場成正比，E_c[keV] = 0.665E²B：SWLS 6 T → 0.665×2.25×6 ≈ 8.98 keV；SW6 3.2 T → 4.79 keV；IASW 3.1 T → 4.64 keV。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"An insertion device's critical energy is proportional to its field, E_c[keV] = 0.665E²B: the 6 T SWLS gives 0.665×2.25×6 ≈ 8.98 keV, the 3.2 T SW6 4.79 keV and the 3.1 T IASW 4.64 keV. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":10},{"id":"a486-v12-11","title":"超導插件：把 1.5 GeV 環推向硬 X 光：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Superconducting insertion devices push a 1.5 GeV ring to hard X-rays: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"],"prerequisiteIds":["a486-v12-10"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「6 T 超導波長位移器與超導扭擺器」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “6 T wavelength shifter and superconducting wigglers” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"IASW 勵磁斜坡時同步記錄工作點與軌道，確認四極補償表把工作點偏移壓回；量測扭擺器光束線在 5 至 23 keV 的通量並與偶極比較（文獻報告 15 keV 約為偶極的 500 倍）；監測液氦消耗（約 2.5 L/h）、真空與失超紀錄，作為低溫負載的驗收依據。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Log tunes and orbit while ramping the IASW to confirm that the quadrupole compensation table restores the tunes; measure wiggler-beamline flux from 5 to 23 keV against a bending magnet (about 500 times at 15 keV was reported); monitor liquid-helium consumption (about 2.5 L/h), vacuum and quench records as the cryogenic-load acceptance. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：IASW 的磁鐵中心若未相對理想軌道偏移足夠距離，同步光打到冷壁，熱負載使液氦蒸發加速甚至失超；SWLS 每圈 13.9 keV 的額外損失改變阻尼與能量分散，若晶格未重新匹配，束流尺寸擴大，所有光束線的亮度一起下降。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: If the IASW magnet centre is not offset far enough from the ideal orbit, synchrotron light strikes the cold wall, accelerating helium boil-off or quenching the magnet; the SWLS's extra 13.9 keV per turn changes damping and energy spread, and without lattice rematching the beam grows and brightness falls on every beamline.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a486-v12-11-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"IASW 勵磁斜坡時同步記錄工作點與軌道，確認四極補償表把工作點偏移壓回；量測扭擺器光束線在 5 至 23 keV 的通量並與偶極比較（文獻報告 15 keV 約為偶極的 500 倍）；監測液氦消耗（約 2.5 L/h）、真空與失超紀錄，作為低溫負載的驗收依據。","textEn":"Log tunes and orbit while ramping the IASW to confirm that the quadrupole compensation table restores the tunes; measure wiggler-beamline flux from 5 to 23 keV against a bending magnet (about 500 times at 15 keV was reported); monitor liquid-helium consumption (about 2.5 L/h), vacuum and quench records as the cryogenic-load acceptance.","sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"]},{"id":"a486-v12-11-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「超導插件：把 1.5 GeV 環推向硬 X 光」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Superconducting insertion devices push a 1.5 GeV ring to hard X-rays\"?","options":["只看單次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準件或重複量測。","能量只提高 15%，同步輻射功率也只增加約 15%。","IASW 勵磁斜坡時同步記錄工作點與軌道，確認四極補償表把工作點偏移壓回。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the result; no reference artefact or repeat measurement is needed.","Raising energy by 15% raises synchrotron-radiation power by only about 15%.","Log tunes and orbit while ramping the IASW to confirm that the quadrupole compensation table restores the tunes."],"answer":2,"explanation":"IASW 勵磁斜坡時同步記錄工作點與軌道，確認四極補償表把工作點偏移壓回；量測扭擺器光束線在 5 至 23 keV 的通量並與偶極比較（文獻報告 15 keV 約為偶極的 500 倍）；監測液氦消耗（約 2.5 L/h）、真空與失超紀錄，作為低溫負載的驗收依據。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Log tunes and orbit while ramping the IASW to confirm that the quadrupole compensation table restores the tunes; measure wiggler-beamline flux from 5 to 23 keV against a bending magnet (about 500 times at 15 keV was reported); monitor liquid-helium consumption (about 2.5 L/h), vacuum and quench records as the cryogenic-load acceptance. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":11},{"id":"a486-v12-12","title":"超導插件：把 1.5 GeV 環推向硬 X 光：失效診斷","titleEn":"Superconducting insertion devices push a 1.5 GeV ring to hard X-rays: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"],"prerequisiteIds":["a486-v12-11"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「6 T 超導波長位移器與超導扭擺器」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “6 T wavelength shifter and superconducting wigglers” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"IASW 的磁鐵中心若未相對理想軌道偏移足夠距離，同步光打到冷壁，熱負載使液氦蒸發加速甚至失超；SWLS 每圈 13.9 keV 的額外損失改變阻尼與能量分散，若晶格未重新匹配，束流尺寸擴大，所有光束線的亮度一起下降。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"If the IASW magnet centre is not offset far enough from the ideal orbit, synchrotron light strikes the cold wall, accelerating helium boil-off or quenching the magnet; the SWLS's extra 13.9 keV per turn changes damping and energy spread, and without lattice rematching the beam grows and brightness falls on every beamline. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：這些插件浸在 4.5 K 液氦中，啟用時需以四極補償工作點偏移，並評估它們對發射度與能量分散的影響。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: These devices are immersed in 4.5 K liquid helium, and switching them on requires quadrupole compensation of the tune shift and assessment of their effect on emittance and energy spread.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「超導扭擺器只是讓光變亮，對儲存環的束流動力學沒有影響。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A superconducting wiggler only brightens the light and leaves ring beam dynamics untouched.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a486-v12-12-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"IASW 的磁鐵中心若未相對理想軌道偏移足夠距離，同步光打到冷壁，熱負載使液氦蒸發加速甚至失超；SWLS 每圈 13.9 keV 的額外損失改變阻尼與能量分散，若晶格未重新匹配，束流尺寸擴大，所有光束線的亮度一起下降。","textEn":"If the IASW magnet centre is not offset far enough from the ideal orbit, synchrotron light strikes the cold wall, accelerating helium boil-off or quenching the magnet; the SWLS's extra 13.9 keV per turn changes damping and energy spread, and without lattice rematching the beam grows and brightness falls on every beamline.","sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"]},{"id":"a486-v12-12-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「超導插件：把 1.5 GeV 環推向硬 X 光」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Superconducting insertion devices push a 1.5 GeV ring to hard X-rays\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["IASW 的磁鐵中心若未相對理想軌道偏移足夠距離，同步光打到冷壁，熱負載使液氦蒸發加速甚至失超。","異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","改用超導腔只是為了省電，對束流穩定性沒有幫助。"],"optionsEn":["If the IASW magnet centre is not offset far enough from the ideal orbit, synchrotron light strikes the cold wall, accelerating helium boil-off or quenching the magnet.","An anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","The switch to an SRF cavity was only about saving power, not beam stability."],"answer":0,"explanation":"IASW 的磁鐵中心若未相對理想軌道偏移足夠距離，同步光打到冷壁，熱負載使液氦蒸發加速甚至失超；SWLS 每圈 13.9 keV 的額外損失改變阻尼與能量分散，若晶格未重新匹配，束流尺寸擴大，所有光束線的亮度一起下降。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"If the IASW magnet centre is not offset far enough from the ideal orbit, synchrotron light strikes the cold wall, accelerating helium boil-off or quenching the magnet; the SWLS's extra 13.9 keV per turn changes damping and energy spread, and without lattice rematching the beam grows and brightness falls on every beamline. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":12},{"id":"a486-v12-13","title":"超導射頻升級、高次模與束流負載：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"SRF upgrade, higher-order modes and beam loading: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"],"prerequisiteIds":["a486-v12-12"],"objective":"說明「CESR 型 500 MHz 超導腔」如何決定台灣同步輻射光源 TLS的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “CESR-type 500 MHz SRF cavity” determines the key performance of “Taiwan Light Source”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"TLS 原本使用銅製 Doris 腔，其高次模與束流相互作用引起耦合束團不穩定，限制了儲存電流。2004 年底改裝以 Cornell CESR-III 設計為基礎、由 ACCEL 製造的單 cell 鈮超導腔，2005 年 2 月起例行運轉：超導腔可用大口徑束管讓高次模傳出腔外吸收，並以單一腔提供足夠電壓。配合 100 kW 速調管發射機，電流由 200 mA 提升到 300 mA，再到 360 mA；但高電流下束流負載很重，低階射頻迴路需精細調整才能穩定。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「CESR 型 500 MHz 超導腔」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"TLS originally used copper Doris cavities whose higher-order modes drove coupled-bunch instabilities that capped the stored current. At the end of 2004 it installed a single-cell niobium cavity based on Cornell's CESR-III design and built by ACCEL, in routine use from February 2005: the superconducting cavity can use large beam pipes that let higher-order modes escape to absorbers, and one cavity supplies enough voltage. With a 100 kW klystron transmitter the current rose from 200 mA to 300 mA and later 360 mA, but beam loading at high current is heavy and the low-level RF loops needed careful tuning to stay stable. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “CESR-type 500 MHz SRF cavity”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：束流負載參數 Y = 2I₀(R/Q)Q_L/V_c。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: The beam-loading parameter is Y = 2I₀(R/Q)Q_L/V_c.","failure":"常見誤解：「改用超導腔只是為了省電，對束流穩定性沒有幫助。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"The switch to an SRF cavity was only about saving power, not beam stability.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「CESR 型 500 MHz 超導腔」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “CESR-type 500 MHz SRF cavity”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a486-v12-13-k1","title":"超導射頻升級、高次模與束流負載","titleEn":"SRF upgrade, higher-order modes and beam loading","text":"TLS 原本使用銅製 Doris 腔，其高次模與束流相互作用引起耦合束團不穩定，限制了儲存電流。2004 年底改裝以 Cornell CESR-III 設計為基礎、由 ACCEL 製造的單 cell 鈮超導腔，2005 年 2 月起例行運轉：超導腔可用大口徑束管讓高次模傳出腔外吸收，並以單一腔提供足夠電壓。","textEn":"TLS originally used copper Doris cavities whose higher-order modes drove coupled-bunch instabilities that capped the stored current. At the end of 2004 it installed a single-cell niobium cavity based on Cornell's CESR-III design and built by ACCEL, in routine use from February 2005: the superconducting cavity can use large beam pipes that let higher-order modes escape to absorbers, and one cavity supplies enough voltage.","sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"]},{"id":"a486-v12-13-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：改用超導腔只是為了省電，對束流穩定性沒有幫助。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: The switch to an SRF cavity was only about saving power, not beam stability. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「超導射頻升級、高次模與束流負載」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"SRF upgrade, higher-order modes and beam loading\" is correct?","options":["改用超導腔只是為了省電，對束流穩定性沒有幫助。","TLS 原本使用銅製 Doris 腔，其高次模與束流相互作用引起耦合束團不穩定，限制了儲存電流。","實施頂注以後，束流壽命就不再重要。"],"optionsEn":["The switch to an SRF cavity was only about saving power, not beam stability.","TLS originally used copper Doris cavities whose higher-order modes drove coupled-bunch instabilities that capped the stored current.","With top-up running, beam lifetime no longer matters."],"answer":1,"explanation":"TLS 原本使用銅製 Doris 腔，其高次模與束流相互作用引起耦合束團不穩定，限制了儲存電流。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"TLS originally used copper Doris cavities whose higher-order modes drove coupled-bunch instabilities that capped the stored current. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":13},{"id":"a486-v12-14","title":"超導射頻升級、高次模與束流負載：定量估算","titleEn":"SRF upgrade, higher-order modes and beam loading: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"],"prerequisiteIds":["a486-v12-13"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「CESR 型 500 MHz 超導腔」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “CESR-type 500 MHz SRF cavity” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：束流負載參數 Y = 2I₀(R/Q)Q_L/V_c。假設 (R/Q) = 44.5 Ω（電路定義）、Q_L = 2.3×10⁵、V_c = 1.5 MV、I₀ = 0.3 A：Y = 2×0.3×44.5×2.3×10⁵/1.5×10⁶ ≈ 4.1，與文獻報告 300 mA 時的 4.2 一致。功率：U₀ 128 keV 加插件約 40 keV（假設）= 168 keV，360 mA 時束流功率 ≈ 61 kW，100 kW 速調管仍有餘裕。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: The beam-loading parameter is Y = 2I₀(R/Q)Q_L/V_c. Assuming (R/Q) = 44.5 Ω (circuit definition), Q_L = 2.3×10⁵, V_c = 1.5 MV and I₀ = 0.3 A, Y = 2×0.3×44.5×2.3×10⁵/1.5×10⁶ ≈ 4.1, consistent with the reported 4.2 at 300 mA. Power: U₀ of 128 keV plus about 40 keV from insertion devices (assumed) is 168 keV, about 61 kW of beam power at 360 mA, leaving margin on the 100 kW klystron. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：以網路分析儀與束流頻譜量測高次模頻率與阻尼後的品質因數，確認沒有落在束流頻譜線上；量測腔失諧角對束流電流的關係，與 Y 的預測比較；統計射頻跳脫率（2005 年約每週一次，目標每月少於一次）作為可用度驗收指標。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Measure higher-order-mode frequencies and damped quality factors with a network analyser and the beam spectrum, confirming none sits on a beam line; measure cavity detuning versus beam current and compare with the Y prediction; track the RF trip rate (about one per week in 2005, target under one per month) as the availability acceptance metric.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a486-v12-14-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"束流負載參數 Y = 2I₀(R/Q)Q_L/V_c。假設 (R/Q) = 44.5 Ω（電路定義）、Q_L = 2.3×10⁵、V_c = 1.5 MV、I₀ = 0.3 A：Y = 2×0.3×44.5×2.3×10⁵/1.5×10⁶ ≈ 4.1，與文獻報告 300 mA 時的 4.2 一致。功率：U₀ 128 keV 加插件約 40 keV（假設）= 168 keV，360 mA 時束流功率 ≈ 61 kW，100 kW 速調管仍有餘裕。","textEn":"The beam-loading parameter is Y = 2I₀(R/Q)Q_L/V_c. Assuming (R/Q) = 44.5 Ω (circuit definition), Q_L = 2.3×10⁵, V_c = 1.5 MV and I₀ = 0.3 A, Y = 2×0.3×44.5×2.3×10⁵/1.5×10⁶ ≈ 4.1, consistent with the reported 4.2 at 300 mA. Power: U₀ of 128 keV plus about 40 keV from insertion devices (assumed) is 168 keV, about 61 kW of beam power at 360 mA, leaving margin on the 100 kW klystron.","sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"]},{"id":"a486-v12-14-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「超導射頻升級、高次模與束流負載」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"SRF upgrade, higher-order modes and beam loading\", which statement holds?","options":["低能量環的波盪器也能輕易產生 10 keV 以上的基頻 X 光。","能量只提高 15%，同步輻射功率也只增加約 15%。","束流負載參數 Y = 2I₀(R/Q)Q_L/V_c。"],"optionsEn":["An undulator on a low-energy ring can just as easily produce a fundamental above 10 keV.","Raising energy by 15% raises synchrotron-radiation power by only about 15%.","The beam-loading parameter is Y = 2I₀(R/Q)Q_L/V_c."],"answer":2,"explanation":"束流負載參數 Y = 2I₀(R/Q)Q_L/V_c。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"The beam-loading parameter is Y = 2I₀(R/Q)Q_L/V_c. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":14},{"id":"a486-v12-15","title":"超導射頻升級、高次模與束流負載：量測與驗證","titleEn":"SRF upgrade, higher-order modes and beam loading: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"],"prerequisiteIds":["a486-v12-14"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「CESR 型 500 MHz 超導腔」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “CESR-type 500 MHz SRF cavity” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"以網路分析儀與束流頻譜量測高次模頻率與阻尼後的品質因數，確認沒有落在束流頻譜線上；量測腔失諧角對束流電流的關係，與 Y 的預測比較；統計射頻跳脫率（2005 年約每週一次，目標每月少於一次）作為可用度驗收指標。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Measure higher-order-mode frequencies and damped quality factors with a network analyser and the beam spectrum, confirming none sits on a beam line; measure cavity detuning versus beam current and compare with the Y prediction; track the RF trip rate (about one per week in 2005, target under one per month) as the availability acceptance metric. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：高束流負載下若直接回授與調諧迴路增益不匹配，腔電壓與相位振盪，束流出現縱向振盪甚至 Robinson 不穩定而掉束；低溫系統壓力波動使腔頻率漂移，調諧器追蹤不及也會造成跳脫。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Under heavy beam loading, mismatched direct-feedback and tuner-loop gains make cavity voltage and phase oscillate, and the beam develops longitudinal oscillation or even Robinson instability and is lost; cryogenic pressure fluctuations shift the cavity frequency, and a tuner that cannot follow also causes trips.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a486-v12-15-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以網路分析儀與束流頻譜量測高次模頻率與阻尼後的品質因數，確認沒有落在束流頻譜線上；量測腔失諧角對束流電流的關係，與 Y 的預測比較；統計射頻跳脫率（2005 年約每週一次，目標每月少於一次）作為可用度驗收指標。","textEn":"Measure higher-order-mode frequencies and damped quality factors with a network analyser and the beam spectrum, confirming none sits on a beam line; measure cavity detuning versus beam current and compare with the Y prediction; track the RF trip rate (about one per week in 2005, target under one per month) as the availability acceptance metric.","sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"]},{"id":"a486-v12-15-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「超導射頻升級、高次模與束流負載」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"SRF upgrade, higher-order modes and beam loading\"?","options":["以網路分析儀與束流頻譜量測高次模頻率與阻尼後的品質因數，確認沒有落在束流頻譜線上。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","能量較低的 TLS，發射度一定比 3 GeV 的 TPS 小。"],"optionsEn":["Measure higher-order-mode frequencies and damped quality factors with a network analyser and the beam spectrum, confirming none sits on a beam line.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","Because TLS has lower energy, its emittance must be smaller than that of 3 GeV TPS."],"answer":0,"explanation":"以網路分析儀與束流頻譜量測高次模頻率與阻尼後的品質因數，確認沒有落在束流頻譜線上；量測腔失諧角對束流電流的關係，與 Y 的預測比較；統計射頻跳脫率（2005 年約每週一次，目標每月少於一次）作為可用度驗收指標。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Measure higher-order-mode frequencies and damped quality factors with a network analyser and the beam spectrum, confirming none sits on a beam line; measure cavity detuning versus beam current and compare with the Y prediction; track the RF trip rate (about one per week in 2005, target under one per month) as the availability acceptance metric. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":15},{"id":"a486-v12-16","title":"超導射頻升級、高次模與束流負載：失效診斷","titleEn":"SRF upgrade, higher-order modes and beam loading: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"],"prerequisiteIds":["a486-v12-15"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「CESR 型 500 MHz 超導腔」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “CESR-type 500 MHz SRF cavity” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"高束流負載下若直接回授與調諧迴路增益不匹配，腔電壓與相位振盪，束流出現縱向振盪甚至 Robinson 不穩定而掉束；低溫系統壓力波動使腔頻率漂移，調諧器追蹤不及也會造成跳脫。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Under heavy beam loading, mismatched direct-feedback and tuner-loop gains make cavity voltage and phase oscillate, and the beam develops longitudinal oscillation or even Robinson instability and is lost; cryogenic pressure fluctuations shift the cavity frequency, and a tuner that cannot follow also causes trips. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：配合 100 kW 速調管發射機，電流由 200 mA 提升到 300 mA，再到 360 mA；但高電流下束流負載很重，低階射頻迴路需精細調整才能穩定。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: With a 100 kW klystron transmitter the current rose from 200 mA to 300 mA and later 360 mA, but beam loading at high current is heavy and the low-level RF loops needed careful tuning to stay stable.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「改用超導腔只是為了省電，對束流穩定性沒有幫助。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"The switch to an SRF cavity was only about saving power, not beam stability.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a486-v12-16-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"高束流負載下若直接回授與調諧迴路增益不匹配，腔電壓與相位振盪，束流出現縱向振盪甚至 Robinson 不穩定而掉束；低溫系統壓力波動使腔頻率漂移，調諧器追蹤不及也會造成跳脫。","textEn":"Under heavy beam loading, mismatched direct-feedback and tuner-loop gains make cavity voltage and phase oscillate, and the beam develops longitudinal oscillation or even Robinson instability and is lost; cryogenic pressure fluctuations shift the cavity frequency, and a tuner that cannot follow also causes trips.","sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"]},{"id":"a486-v12-16-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「超導射頻升級、高次模與束流負載」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"SRF upgrade, higher-order modes and beam loading\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的零件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","高束流負載下若直接回授與調諧迴路增益不匹配，腔電壓與相位振盪，束流出現縱向振盪甚至 Robinson 不穩定而掉束。","實施頂注以後，束流壽命就不再重要。"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive part first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","Under heavy beam loading, mismatched direct-feedback and tuner-loop gains make cavity voltage and phase oscillate, and the beam develops longitudinal oscillation or even Robinson instability and is lost.","With top-up running, beam lifetime no longer matters."],"answer":1,"explanation":"高束流負載下若直接回授與調諧迴路增益不匹配，腔電壓與相位振盪，束流出現縱向振盪甚至 Robinson 不穩定而掉束；低溫系統壓力波動使腔頻率漂移，調諧器追蹤不及也會造成跳脫。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Under heavy beam loading, mismatched direct-feedback and tuner-loop gains make cavity voltage and phase oscillate, and the beam develops longitudinal oscillation or even Robinson instability and is lost; cryogenic pressure fluctuations shift the cavity frequency, and a tuner that cannot follow also causes trips. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":16}],"order":2},{"id":"a486-v12-s3","title":"量測、校正與誤差預算","titleEn":"Measurement, calibration and error budgets","description":"本階段聚焦「頂注運轉的電流穩定度與壽命推算」與「TPS 施工期間的地層變形監測」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Top-up current stability and lifetime inference\" and \"Ground-deformation monitoring during TPS construction\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a486-v12-17","title":"頂注運轉的電流穩定度與壽命推算：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Top-up current stability and lifetime inference: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"],"prerequisiteIds":["a486-v12-16"],"objective":"說明「直流電流變壓器與頂注閘控」如何決定台灣同步輻射光源 TLS的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “DCCT and top-up gating” determines the key performance of “Taiwan Light Source”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"TLS 於 2005 年 10 月由衰減模式改為頂注運轉：約每 60 s 由全能量增能環補注一次，使儲存電流維持在 ±0.25% 之內，光束線熱負載近乎恆定，光學元件不再隨電流衰減而漂移。量測核心是直流電流變壓器（DCCT），它的解析度與零點漂移決定能否分辨 0.1% 等級的電流變化，並用來推算壽命與每次補注的電荷。補注瞬間踢擊磁鐵造成的擾動以閘控訊號通知用戶，讓實驗資料可排除注入時段。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「直流電流變壓器與頂注閘控」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"TLS moved from decay mode to top-up in October 2005: about every 60 s the full-energy booster tops up the ring, holding stored current within ±0.25%, so beamline heat loads stay nearly constant and optics no longer drift with decaying current. The key measurement is the DC current transformer (DCCT), whose resolution and zero drift determine whether 0.1%-level current changes can be seen and which is used to infer lifetime and the charge per top-up. The kicker disturbance at each injection is announced to users by a gating signal so experiments can exclude those intervals. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “DCCT and top-up gating”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：若每 60 s 正好用完 ±0.25% 的帶寬（ΔI/I = 0.5%），等效壽命 τ = Δt/(ΔI/I) = 60/0.005 = 1.2×10⁴ s ≈ 3.3 h。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: If each 60 s interval uses the full ±0.25% band (ΔI/I = 0.5%), the equivalent lifetime is τ = Δt/(ΔI/I) = 60/0.005 = 1.2×10⁴ s ≈ 3.3 h.","failure":"常見誤解：「實施頂注以後，束流壽命就不再重要。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"With top-up running, beam lifetime no longer matters.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「直流電流變壓器與頂注閘控」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “DCCT and top-up gating”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a486-v12-17-k1","title":"頂注運轉的電流穩定度與壽命推算","titleEn":"Top-up current stability and lifetime inference","text":"TLS 於 2005 年 10 月由衰減模式改為頂注運轉：約每 60 s 由全能量增能環補注一次，使儲存電流維持在 ±0.25% 之內，光束線熱負載近乎恆定，光學元件不再隨電流衰減而漂移。量測核心是直流電流變壓器（DCCT），它的解析度與零點漂移決定能否分辨 0.1% 等級的電流變化，並用來推算壽命與每次補注的電荷。","textEn":"TLS moved from decay mode to top-up in October 2005: about every 60 s the full-energy booster tops up the ring, holding stored current within ±0.25%, so beamline heat loads stay nearly constant and optics no longer drift with decaying current. The key measurement is the DC current transformer (DCCT), whose resolution and zero drift determine whether 0.1%-level current changes can be seen and which is used to infer lifetime and the charge per top-up.","sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"]},{"id":"a486-v12-17-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：實施頂注以後，束流壽命就不再重要。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: With top-up running, beam lifetime no longer matters. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「頂注運轉的電流穩定度與壽命推算」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Top-up current stability and lifetime inference\" is correct?","options":["實施頂注以後，束流壽命就不再重要。","軌道回授可以補償任何地面變形，因此不必監測地層。","TLS 於 2005 年 10 月由衰減模式改為頂注運轉：約每 60 s 由全能量增能環補注一次，使儲存電流維持在 ±0.25% 之內，光束線熱負載近乎恆定，光學元件不再隨電流衰減而漂移。"],"optionsEn":["With top-up running, beam lifetime no longer matters.","Orbit feedback compensates any ground motion, so ground monitoring is unnecessary.","TLS moved from decay mode to top-up in October 2005: about every 60 s the full-energy booster tops up the ring, holding stored current within ±0.25%, so beamline heat loads stay nearly constant and optics no longer drift with decaying current."],"answer":2,"explanation":"TLS 於 2005 年 10 月由衰減模式改為頂注運轉：約每 60 s 由全能量增能環補注一次，使儲存電流維持在 ±0.25% 之內，光束線熱負載近乎恆定，光學元件不再隨電流衰減而漂移。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"TLS moved from decay mode to top-up in October 2005: about every 60 s the full-energy booster tops up the ring, holding stored current within ±0.25%, so beamline heat loads stay nearly constant and optics no longer drift with decaying current. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":17},{"id":"a486-v12-18","title":"頂注運轉的電流穩定度與壽命推算：定量估算","titleEn":"Top-up current stability and lifetime inference: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"],"prerequisiteIds":["a486-v12-17"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「直流電流變壓器與頂注閘控」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “DCCT and top-up gating” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：若每 60 s 正好用完 ±0.25% 的帶寬（ΔI/I = 0.5%），等效壽命 τ = Δt/(ΔI/I) = 60/0.005 = 1.2×10⁴ s ≈ 3.3 h。300 mA 時每次補注 ΔI = 1.5 mA，迴轉週期 T₀ = 120 m/c ≈ 0.400 µs，電荷 ΔQ = ΔI·T₀ ≈ 0.60 nC，約 3.7×10⁹ 個電子。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: If each 60 s interval uses the full ±0.25% band (ΔI/I = 0.5%), the equivalent lifetime is τ = Δt/(ΔI/I) = 60/0.005 = 1.2×10⁴ s ≈ 3.3 h. At 300 mA each top-up adds ΔI = 1.5 mA; with revolution period T₀ = 120 m/c ≈ 0.400 µs the charge is ΔQ = ΔI·T₀ ≈ 0.60 nC, about 3.7×10⁹ electrons. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：以校正線圈通入已知電流檢查 DCCT 的刻度與零點漂移，並與注入線積分電流變壓器比對注入效率；在暫停補注的時段擬合電流指數衰減求 τ，於不同束團填充模式與垂直發射度下重複量測，分辨 Touschek 與殘氣的貢獻。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Pass a known current through a calibration winding to check DCCT scale and zero drift, and compare with the injection-line integrating transformer to obtain injection efficiency; fit the exponential current decay during a pause in top-up to obtain τ, repeating under different fill patterns and vertical emittances to separate Touschek and residual-gas contributions.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a486-v12-18-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"若每 60 s 正好用完 ±0.25% 的帶寬（ΔI/I = 0.5%），等效壽命 τ = Δt/(ΔI/I) = 60/0.005 = 1.2×10⁴ s ≈ 3.3 h。300 mA 時每次補注 ΔI = 1.5 mA，迴轉週期 T₀ = 120 m/c ≈ 0.400 µs，電荷 ΔQ = ΔI·T₀ ≈ 0.60 nC，約 3.7×10⁹ 個電子。","textEn":"If each 60 s interval uses the full ±0.25% band (ΔI/I = 0.5%), the equivalent lifetime is τ = Δt/(ΔI/I) = 60/0.005 = 1.2×10⁴ s ≈ 3.3 h. At 300 mA each top-up adds ΔI = 1.5 mA; with revolution period T₀ = 120 m/c ≈ 0.400 µs the charge is ΔQ = ΔI·T₀ ≈ 0.60 nC, about 3.7×10⁹ electrons.","sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"]},{"id":"a486-v12-18-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「頂注運轉的電流穩定度與壽命推算」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Top-up current stability and lifetime inference\", which statement holds?","options":["若每 60 s 正好用完 ±0.25% 的帶寬（ΔI/I = 0.5%），等效壽命 τ = Δt/(ΔI/I) = 60/0.005 = 1.2×10⁴ s ≈ 3.3 h。","TPS 完工後 TLS 就失去用處，應該立即停機。","能量較低的 TLS，發射度一定比 3 GeV 的 TPS 小。"],"optionsEn":["If each 60 s interval uses the full ±0.25% band (ΔI/I = 0.5%), the equivalent lifetime is τ = Δt/(ΔI/I) = 60/0.005 = 1.2×10⁴ s ≈ 3.3 h.","Once TPS operated, TLS became useless and should have shut down at once.","Because TLS has lower energy, its emittance must be smaller than that of 3 GeV TPS."],"answer":0,"explanation":"若每 60 s 正好用完 ±0.25% 的帶寬（ΔI/I = 0.5%），等效壽命 τ = Δt/(ΔI/I) = 60/0.005 = 1.2×10⁴ s ≈ 3.3 h。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"If each 60 s interval uses the full ±0.25% band (ΔI/I = 0.5%), the equivalent lifetime is τ = Δt/(ΔI/I) = 60/0.005 = 1.2×10⁴ s ≈ 3.3 h. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":18},{"id":"a486-v12-19","title":"頂注運轉的電流穩定度與壽命推算：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Top-up current stability and lifetime inference: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"],"prerequisiteIds":["a486-v12-18"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「直流電流變壓器與頂注閘控」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “DCCT and top-up gating” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"以校正線圈通入已知電流檢查 DCCT 的刻度與零點漂移，並與注入線積分電流變壓器比對注入效率；在暫停補注的時段擬合電流指數衰減求 τ，於不同束團填充模式與垂直發射度下重複量測，分辨 Touschek 與殘氣的貢獻。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Pass a known current through a calibration winding to check DCCT scale and zero drift, and compare with the injection-line integrating transformer to obtain injection efficiency; fit the exponential current decay during a pause in top-up to obtain τ, repeating under different fill patterns and vertical emittances to separate Touschek and residual-gas contributions. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：注入凸軌不完全閉合時，每次補注都讓儲存束流振盪數毫秒，光束線看到週期性的強度尖峰；DCCT 零點漂移 0.5 mA 而未校正時，頂注控制把電流維持在錯誤的值，用戶以電流歸一化的數據出現系統誤差。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: An imperfectly closed injection bump makes the stored beam oscillate for milliseconds at every top-up, and beamlines see periodic intensity spikes; an uncorrected 0.5 mA DCCT zero drift makes top-up regulate to the wrong current, introducing systematic error into user data normalized by current.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a486-v12-19-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以校正線圈通入已知電流檢查 DCCT 的刻度與零點漂移，並與注入線積分電流變壓器比對注入效率；在暫停補注的時段擬合電流指數衰減求 τ，於不同束團填充模式與垂直發射度下重複量測，分辨 Touschek 與殘氣的貢獻。","textEn":"Pass a known current through a calibration winding to check DCCT scale and zero drift, and compare with the injection-line integrating transformer to obtain injection efficiency; fit the exponential current decay during a pause in top-up to obtain τ, repeating under different fill patterns and vertical emittances to separate Touschek and residual-gas contributions.","sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"]},{"id":"a486-v12-19-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「頂注運轉的電流穩定度與壽命推算」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Top-up current stability and lifetime inference\"?","options":["允收準則可以等看到量測數據後再決定。","以校正線圈通入已知電流檢查 DCCT 的刻度與零點漂移，並與注入線積分電流變壓器比對注入效率。","超導扭擺器只是讓光變亮，對儲存環的束流動力學沒有影響。"],"optionsEn":["Acceptance criteria can be decided after the measured data have been seen.","Pass a known current through a calibration winding to check DCCT scale and zero drift, and compare with the injection-line integrating transformer to obtain injection efficiency.","A superconducting wiggler only brightens the light and leaves ring beam dynamics untouched."],"answer":1,"explanation":"以校正線圈通入已知電流檢查 DCCT 的刻度與零點漂移，並與注入線積分電流變壓器比對注入效率；在暫停補注的時段擬合電流指數衰減求 τ，於不同束團填充模式與垂直發射度下重複量測，分辨 Touschek 與殘氣的貢獻。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Pass a known current through a calibration winding to check DCCT scale and zero drift, and compare with the injection-line integrating transformer to obtain injection efficiency; fit the exponential current decay during a pause in top-up to obtain τ, repeating under different fill patterns and vertical emittances to separate Touschek and residual-gas contributions. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":19},{"id":"a486-v12-20","title":"頂注運轉的電流穩定度與壽命推算：失效診斷","titleEn":"Top-up current stability and lifetime inference: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"],"prerequisiteIds":["a486-v12-19"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「直流電流變壓器與頂注閘控」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “DCCT and top-up gating” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"注入凸軌不完全閉合時，每次補注都讓儲存束流振盪數毫秒，光束線看到週期性的強度尖峰；DCCT 零點漂移 0.5 mA 而未校正時，頂注控制把電流維持在錯誤的值，用戶以電流歸一化的數據出現系統誤差。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"An imperfectly closed injection bump makes the stored beam oscillate for milliseconds at every top-up, and beamlines see periodic intensity spikes; an uncorrected 0.5 mA DCCT zero drift makes top-up regulate to the wrong current, introducing systematic error into user data normalized by current. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：補注瞬間踢擊磁鐵造成的擾動以閘控訊號通知用戶，讓實驗資料可排除注入時段。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The kicker disturbance at each injection is announced to users by a gating signal so experiments can exclude those intervals.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「實施頂注以後，束流壽命就不再重要。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"With top-up running, beam lifetime no longer matters.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a486-v12-20-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"注入凸軌不完全閉合時，每次補注都讓儲存束流振盪數毫秒，光束線看到週期性的強度尖峰；DCCT 零點漂移 0.5 mA 而未校正時，頂注控制把電流維持在錯誤的值，用戶以電流歸一化的數據出現系統誤差。","textEn":"An imperfectly closed injection bump makes the stored beam oscillate for milliseconds at every top-up, and beamlines see periodic intensity spikes; an uncorrected 0.5 mA DCCT zero drift makes top-up regulate to the wrong current, introducing systematic error into user data normalized by current.","sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"]},{"id":"a486-v12-20-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「頂注運轉的電流穩定度與壽命推算」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Top-up current stability and lifetime inference\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["症狀相同就代表原因相同，不必用量測區分。","軌道回授可以補償任何地面變形，因此不必監測地層。","注入凸軌不完全閉合時，每次補注都讓儲存束流振盪數毫秒，光束線看到週期性的強度尖峰。"],"optionsEn":["Identical symptoms always mean identical causes, so no discriminating measurement is needed.","Orbit feedback compensates any ground motion, so ground monitoring is unnecessary.","An imperfectly closed injection bump makes the stored beam oscillate for milliseconds at every top-up, and beamlines see periodic intensity spikes."],"answer":2,"explanation":"注入凸軌不完全閉合時，每次補注都讓儲存束流振盪數毫秒，光束線看到週期性的強度尖峰；DCCT 零點漂移 0.5 mA 而未校正時，頂注控制把電流維持在錯誤的值，用戶以電流歸一化的數據出現系統誤差。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"An imperfectly closed injection bump makes the stored beam oscillate for milliseconds at every top-up, and beamlines see periodic intensity spikes; an uncorrected 0.5 mA DCCT zero drift makes top-up regulate to the wrong current, introducing systematic error into user data normalized by current. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":20},{"id":"a486-v12-21","title":"TPS 施工期間的地層變形監測：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Ground-deformation monitoring during TPS construction: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"],"prerequisiteIds":["a486-v12-20"],"objective":"說明「流體靜力水準系統與精密傾斜儀」如何決定台灣同步輻射光源 TLS的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Hydrostatic levelling and precision inclinometers” determines the key performance of “Taiwan Light Source”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"TPS 緊鄰 TLS 興建，開挖與基礎施工會造成地層沉陷與傾斜；若 TLS 的四極磁鐵隨地面移動數十微米，閉合軌道誤差就會被放大到與束流尺寸同量級。NSRRC 在 TLS 儲存環與光束線安裝流體靜力水準系統（HLS）與 Leica Nivel 220 精密傾斜儀，持續記錄垂直沉陷與地板傾斜，作為 TLS 能否維持正常運轉的判據，也讓軌道回授與重新對準有量化依據。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「流體靜力水準系統與精密傾斜儀」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"TPS was built right next to TLS, and excavation and foundation work cause ground settlement and tilt; if TLS quadrupoles move tens of micrometres with the floor, closed-orbit errors are amplified to the scale of the beam size. NSRRC installed a hydrostatic levelling system (HLS) and Leica Nivel 220 precision inclinometers in the TLS storage ring and beamlines to record vertical settlement and floor tilt continuously, providing the criterion for keeping TLS in normal operation and a quantitative basis for orbit feedback and realignment. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Hydrostatic levelling and precision inclinometers”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：單一四極垂直位移 Δ 造成的軌道 y ≈ √(β_qβ)/(2|sin πν|)·KL·Δ。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: A single quadrupole moved vertically by Δ produces y ≈ √(β_qβ)/(2|sin πν|)·KL·Δ.","failure":"常見誤解：「軌道回授可以補償任何地面變形，因此不必監測地層。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Orbit feedback compensates any ground motion, so ground monitoring is unnecessary.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「流體靜力水準系統與精密傾斜儀」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Hydrostatic levelling and precision inclinometers”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a486-v12-21-k1","title":"TPS 施工期間的地層變形監測","titleEn":"Ground-deformation monitoring during TPS construction","text":"TPS 緊鄰 TLS 興建，開挖與基礎施工會造成地層沉陷與傾斜；若 TLS 的四極磁鐵隨地面移動數十微米，閉合軌道誤差就會被放大到與束流尺寸同量級。NSRRC 在 TLS 儲存環與光束線安裝流體靜力水準系統（HLS）與 Leica Nivel 220 精密傾斜儀，持續記錄垂直沉陷與地板傾斜，作為 TLS 能否維持正常運轉的判據，也讓軌道回授與重新對準有量化依據。","textEn":"TPS was built right next to TLS, and excavation and foundation work cause ground settlement and tilt; if TLS quadrupoles move tens of micrometres with the floor, closed-orbit errors are amplified to the scale of the beam size. NSRRC installed a hydrostatic levelling system (HLS) and Leica Nivel 220 precision inclinometers in the TLS storage ring and beamlines to record vertical settlement and floor tilt continuously, providing the criterion for keeping TLS in normal operation and a quantitative basis for orbit feedback and realignment.","sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"]},{"id":"a486-v12-21-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：軌道回授可以補償任何地面變形，因此不必監測地層。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Orbit feedback compensates any ground motion, so ground monitoring is unnecessary. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「TPS 施工期間的地層變形監測」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Ground-deformation monitoring during TPS construction\" is correct?","options":["TPS 緊鄰 TLS 興建，開挖與基礎施工會造成地層沉陷與傾斜；若 TLS 的四極磁鐵隨地面移動數十微米，閉合軌道誤差就會被放大到與束流尺寸同量級。","軌道回授可以補償任何地面變形，因此不必監測地層。","低能量環的波盪器也能輕易產生 10 keV 以上的基頻 X 光。"],"optionsEn":["TPS was built right next to TLS, and excavation and foundation work cause ground settlement and tilt.","Orbit feedback compensates any ground motion, so ground monitoring is unnecessary.","An undulator on a low-energy ring can just as easily produce a fundamental above 10 keV."],"answer":0,"explanation":"TPS 緊鄰 TLS 興建，開挖與基礎施工會造成地層沉陷與傾斜；若 TLS 的四極磁鐵隨地面移動數十微米，閉合軌道誤差就會被放大到與束流尺寸同量級。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"TPS was built right next to TLS, and excavation and foundation work cause ground settlement and tilt; if TLS quadrupoles move tens of micrometres with the floor, closed-orbit errors are amplified to the scale of the beam size. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":21},{"id":"a486-v12-22","title":"TPS 施工期間的地層變形監測：定量估算","titleEn":"Ground-deformation monitoring during TPS construction: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"],"prerequisiteIds":["a486-v12-21"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「流體靜力水準系統與精密傾斜儀」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Hydrostatic levelling and precision inclinometers” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：單一四極垂直位移 Δ 造成的軌道 y ≈ √(β_qβ)/(2|sin πν|)·KL·Δ。假設 β_q = 10 m、量測點 β = 5 m、KL = 0.5 m⁻¹、ν_y = 4.13：係數 ≈ 7.07/(2×0.399)×0.5 ≈ 4.45，Δ = 10 µm 時軌道約 45 µm；以垂直發射度 88 pm·rad、β_y = 5 m 估得 σ_y = √(88×10⁻¹²×5) ≈ 21 µm，擾動約為束流尺寸的 2 倍。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: A single quadrupole moved vertically by Δ produces y ≈ √(β_qβ)/(2|sin πν|)·KL·Δ. Assuming β_q = 10 m, β = 5 m at the observation point, KL = 0.5 m⁻¹ and ν_y = 4.13, the factor is ≈ 7.07/(2×0.399)×0.5 ≈ 4.45, so Δ = 10 µm gives about 45 µm of orbit; with 88 pm·rad vertical emittance and β_y = 5 m, σ_y = √(88×10⁻¹²×5) ≈ 21 µm, so the disturbance is about twice the beam size. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：把 HLS 與傾斜儀的時間序列和 BPM 軌道、修正磁鐵電流做相關分析，找出沉陷與軌道變化的對應；以施工日誌（開挖、灌漿、重機進出）標記事件；每次停機以雷射追蹤儀複測磁鐵高程，與 HLS 推算值比較。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Correlate HLS and inclinometer time series with BPM orbits and corrector currents to map settlement onto orbit change; tag events from the construction log (excavation, concrete pours, heavy machinery); at each shutdown re-survey magnet heights with a laser tracker and compare with HLS-derived values.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a486-v12-22-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"單一四極垂直位移 Δ 造成的軌道 y ≈ √(β_qβ)/(2|sin πν|)·KL·Δ。假設 β_q = 10 m、量測點 β = 5 m、KL = 0.5 m⁻¹、ν_y = 4.13：係數 ≈ 7.07/(2×0.399)×0.5 ≈ 4.45，Δ = 10 µm 時軌道約 45 µm；以垂直發射度 88 pm·rad、β_y = 5 m 估得 σ_y = √(88×10⁻¹²×5) ≈ 21 µm，擾動約為束流尺寸的 2 倍。","textEn":"A single quadrupole moved vertically by Δ produces y ≈ √(β_qβ)/(2|sin πν|)·KL·Δ. Assuming β_q = 10 m, β = 5 m at the observation point, KL = 0.5 m⁻¹ and ν_y = 4.13, the factor is ≈ 7.07/(2×0.399)×0.5 ≈ 4.45, so Δ = 10 µm gives about 45 µm of orbit; with 88 pm·rad vertical emittance and β_y = 5 m, σ_y = √(88×10⁻¹²×5) ≈ 21 µm, so the disturbance is about twice the beam size.","sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"]},{"id":"a486-v12-22-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「TPS 施工期間的地層變形監測」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Ground-deformation monitoring during TPS construction\", which statement holds?","options":["能量只提高 15%，同步輻射功率也只增加約 15%。","單一四極垂直位移 Δ 造成的軌道 y ≈ √(β_qβ)/(2|sin πν|)·KL·Δ。","超導扭擺器只是讓光變亮，對儲存環的束流動力學沒有影響。"],"optionsEn":["Raising energy by 15% raises synchrotron-radiation power by only about 15%.","A single quadrupole moved vertically by Δ produces y ≈ √(β_qβ)/(2|sin πν|)·KL·Δ.","A superconducting wiggler only brightens the light and leaves ring beam dynamics untouched."],"answer":1,"explanation":"單一四極垂直位移 Δ 造成的軌道 y ≈ √(β_qβ)/(2|sin πν|)·KL·Δ。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"A single quadrupole moved vertically by Δ produces y ≈ √(β_qβ)/(2|sin πν|)·KL·Δ. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":22},{"id":"a486-v12-23","title":"TPS 施工期間的地層變形監測：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Ground-deformation monitoring during TPS construction: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"],"prerequisiteIds":["a486-v12-22"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「流體靜力水準系統與精密傾斜儀」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Hydrostatic levelling and precision inclinometers” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"把 HLS 與傾斜儀的時間序列和 BPM 軌道、修正磁鐵電流做相關分析，找出沉陷與軌道變化的對應；以施工日誌（開挖、灌漿、重機進出）標記事件；每次停機以雷射追蹤儀複測磁鐵高程，與 HLS 推算值比較。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Correlate HLS and inclinometer time series with BPM orbits and corrector currents to map settlement onto orbit change; tag events from the construction log (excavation, concrete pours, heavy machinery); at each shutdown re-survey magnet heights with a laser tracker and compare with HLS-derived values. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：只依賴軌道回授而不監測地面，修正磁鐵電流在數月間逐漸用盡行程，某天回授飽和、軌道突然失控；地面傾斜改變光束線與光源的相對角度時，即使電子軌道被修正，樣品上的光點仍會漂移。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Relying only on orbit feedback without ground monitoring lets corrector currents creep to the end of their range over months until feedback saturates and the orbit suddenly escapes; floor tilt that changes the beamline-to-source angle makes the spot on the sample drift even when the electron orbit is corrected.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a486-v12-23-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"把 HLS 與傾斜儀的時間序列和 BPM 軌道、修正磁鐵電流做相關分析，找出沉陷與軌道變化的對應；以施工日誌（開挖、灌漿、重機進出）標記事件；每次停機以雷射追蹤儀複測磁鐵高程，與 HLS 推算值比較。","textEn":"Correlate HLS and inclinometer time series with BPM orbits and corrector currents to map settlement onto orbit change; tag events from the construction log (excavation, concrete pours, heavy machinery); at each shutdown re-survey magnet heights with a laser tracker and compare with HLS-derived values.","sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"]},{"id":"a486-v12-23-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「TPS 施工期間的地層變形監測」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Ground-deformation monitoring during TPS construction\"?","options":["只要模擬結果看起來合理，就可以省略實體量測與校正。","改用超導腔只是為了省電，對束流穩定性沒有幫助。","把 HLS 與傾斜儀的時間序列和 BPM 軌道、修正磁鐵電流做相關分析，找出沉陷與軌道變化的對應。"],"optionsEn":["If the simulation looks reasonable, physical measurement and calibration can be skipped.","The switch to an SRF cavity was only about saving power, not beam stability.","Correlate HLS and inclinometer time series with BPM orbits and corrector currents to map settlement onto orbit change."],"answer":2,"explanation":"把 HLS 與傾斜儀的時間序列和 BPM 軌道、修正磁鐵電流做相關分析，找出沉陷與軌道變化的對應；以施工日誌（開挖、灌漿、重機進出）標記事件；每次停機以雷射追蹤儀複測磁鐵高程，與 HLS 推算值比較。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Correlate HLS and inclinometer time series with BPM orbits and corrector currents to map settlement onto orbit change; tag events from the construction log (excavation, concrete pours, heavy machinery); at each shutdown re-survey magnet heights with a laser tracker and compare with HLS-derived values. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":23},{"id":"a486-v12-24","title":"TPS 施工期間的地層變形監測：失效診斷","titleEn":"Ground-deformation monitoring during TPS construction: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"],"prerequisiteIds":["a486-v12-23"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「流體靜力水準系統與精密傾斜儀」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Hydrostatic levelling and precision inclinometers” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"只依賴軌道回授而不監測地面，修正磁鐵電流在數月間逐漸用盡行程，某天回授飽和、軌道突然失控；地面傾斜改變光束線與光源的相對角度時，即使電子軌道被修正，樣品上的光點仍會漂移。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Relying only on orbit feedback without ground monitoring lets corrector currents creep to the end of their range over months until feedback saturates and the orbit suddenly escapes; floor tilt that changes the beamline-to-source angle makes the spot on the sample drift even when the electron orbit is corrected. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：NSRRC 在 TLS 儲存環與光束線安裝流體靜力水準系統（HLS）與 Leica Nivel 220 精密傾斜儀，持續記錄垂直沉陷與地板傾斜，作為 TLS 能否維持正常運轉的判據，也讓軌道回授與重新對準有量化依據。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: NSRRC installed a hydrostatic levelling system (HLS) and Leica Nivel 220 precision inclinometers in the TLS storage ring and beamlines to record vertical settlement and floor tilt continuously, providing the criterion for keeping TLS in normal operation and a quantitative basis for orbit feedback and realignment.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「軌道回授可以補償任何地面變形，因此不必監測地層。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Orbit feedback compensates any ground motion, so ground monitoring is unnecessary.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a486-v12-24-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"只依賴軌道回授而不監測地面，修正磁鐵電流在數月間逐漸用盡行程，某天回授飽和、軌道突然失控；地面傾斜改變光束線與光源的相對角度時，即使電子軌道被修正，樣品上的光點仍會漂移。","textEn":"Relying only on orbit feedback without ground monitoring lets corrector currents creep to the end of their range over months until feedback saturates and the orbit suddenly escapes; floor tilt that changes the beamline-to-source angle makes the spot on the sample drift even when the electron orbit is corrected.","sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"]},{"id":"a486-v12-24-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「TPS 施工期間的地層變形監測」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Ground-deformation monitoring during TPS construction\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["只依賴軌道回授而不監測地面，修正磁鐵電流在數月間逐漸用盡行程，某天回授飽和、軌道突然失控。","只要重新開機或重設軟體，硬體失效也會一併排除。","低能量環的波盪器也能輕易產生 10 keV 以上的基頻 X 光。"],"optionsEn":["Relying only on orbit feedback without ground monitoring lets corrector currents creep to the end of their range over months until feedback saturates and the orbit suddenly escapes.","Restarting or resetting the software also clears hardware failures.","An undulator on a low-energy ring can just as easily produce a fundamental above 10 keV."],"answer":0,"explanation":"只依賴軌道回授而不監測地面，修正磁鐵電流在數月間逐漸用盡行程，某天回授飽和、軌道突然失控；地面傾斜改變光束線與光源的相對角度時，即使電子軌道被修正，樣品上的光點仍會漂移。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Relying only on orbit feedback without ground monitoring lets corrector currents creep to the end of their range over months until feedback saturates and the orbit suddenly escapes; floor tilt that changes the beamline-to-source angle makes the spot on the sample drift even when the electron orbit is corrected. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":24}],"order":3},{"id":"a486-v12-s4","title":"系統整合、驗證與工程交接","titleEn":"Integration, validation and engineering handoff","description":"本階段聚焦「軟 X 光波盪器與光子能量涵蓋」與「與 TPS 並行運轉的分工、相干度與交接」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Soft-X-ray undulators and photon-energy coverage\" and \"Running alongside TPS: division of labour, coherence and handoff\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a486-v12-25","title":"軟 X 光波盪器與光子能量涵蓋：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Soft-X-ray undulators and photon-energy coverage: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"],"prerequisiteIds":["a486-v12-24"],"objective":"說明「U9、U5 與 EPU5.6 波盪器」如何決定台灣同步輻射光源 TLS的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “U9, U5 and EPU5.6 undulators” determines the key performance of “Taiwan Light Source”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"1.5 GeV 的 TLS 在真空紫外到軟 X 光波段特別有效率：週期 9 cm 的 U9、5 cm 的 U5 與可變偏振的 EPU5.6 等波盪器，把基頻放在數十到數百 eV。波盪器光子能量隨 E² 標度，同一支波盪器搬到 3 GeV 的 TPS，能量會提高 4 倍。偶極光源的 2.14 keV 臨界能量涵蓋到數 keV，更硬的 X 光則交給超導扭擺器。因此 TLS 的光束線以軟 X 光、紅外與成熟的常規技術為主，與 TPS 的硬 X 光高亮度定位互補。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「U9、U5 與 EPU5.6 波盪器」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"The 1.5 GeV TLS is especially efficient from the vacuum ultraviolet to soft X-rays: undulators such as U9 with a 9 cm period, U5 with 5 cm and the variable-polarization EPU5.6 put their fundamentals at tens to hundreds of eV. Undulator photon energy scales as E², so the same device moved to 3 GeV TPS would give four times the energy. The 2.14 keV bending-magnet critical energy covers up to a few keV, and harder X-rays come from the superconducting wigglers. TLS beamlines therefore focus on soft X-rays, infrared and mature routine techniques, complementing the hard-X-ray, high-brightness role of TPS. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “U9, U5 and EPU5.6 undulators”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：波盪器基頻能量為 E₁[keV] = 0.950E²/(λu[cm](1 + K²/2))。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: The undulator fundamental is E₁[keV] = 0.950E²/(λu[cm](1 + K²/2)).","failure":"常見誤解：「低能量環的波盪器也能輕易產生 10 keV 以上的基頻 X 光。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"An undulator on a low-energy ring can just as easily produce a fundamental above 10 keV.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「U9、U5 與 EPU5.6 波盪器」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “U9, U5 and EPU5.6 undulators”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a486-v12-25-k1","title":"軟 X 光波盪器與光子能量涵蓋","titleEn":"Soft-X-ray undulators and photon-energy coverage","text":"1.5 GeV 的 TLS 在真空紫外到軟 X 光波段特別有效率：週期 9 cm 的 U9、5 cm 的 U5 與可變偏振的 EPU5.6 等波盪器，把基頻放在數十到數百 eV。波盪器光子能量隨 E² 標度，同一支波盪器搬到 3 GeV 的 TPS，能量會提高 4 倍。","textEn":"The 1.5 GeV TLS is especially efficient from the vacuum ultraviolet to soft X-rays: undulators such as U9 with a 9 cm period, U5 with 5 cm and the variable-polarization EPU5.6 put their fundamentals at tens to hundreds of eV. Undulator photon energy scales as E², so the same device moved to 3 GeV TPS would give four times the energy.","sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"]},{"id":"a486-v12-25-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：低能量環的波盪器也能輕易產生 10 keV 以上的基頻 X 光。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: An undulator on a low-energy ring can just as easily produce a fundamental above 10 keV. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「軟 X 光波盪器與光子能量涵蓋」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Soft-X-ray undulators and photon-energy coverage\" is correct?","options":["低能量環的波盪器也能輕易產生 10 keV 以上的基頻 X 光。","1.5 GeV 的 TLS 在真空紫外到軟 X 光波段特別有效率：週期 9 cm 的 U9、5 cm 的 U5 與可變偏振的 EPU5.6 等波盪器，把基頻放在數十到數百 eV。","TPS 完工後 TLS 就失去用處，應該立即停機。"],"optionsEn":["An undulator on a low-energy ring can just as easily produce a fundamental above 10 keV.","The 1.5 GeV TLS is especially efficient from the vacuum ultraviolet to soft X-rays: undulators such as U9 with a 9 cm period, U5 with 5 cm and the variable-polarization EPU5.6 put their fundamentals at tens to hundreds of eV.","Once TPS operated, TLS became useless and should have shut down at once."],"answer":1,"explanation":"1.5 GeV 的 TLS 在真空紫外到軟 X 光波段特別有效率：週期 9 cm 的 U9、5 cm 的 U5 與可變偏振的 EPU5.6 等波盪器，把基頻放在數十到數百 eV。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"The 1.5 GeV TLS is especially efficient from the vacuum ultraviolet to soft X-rays: undulators such as U9 with a 9 cm period, U5 with 5 cm and the variable-polarization EPU5.6 put their fundamentals at tens to hundreds of eV. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":25},{"id":"a486-v12-26","title":"軟 X 光波盪器與光子能量涵蓋：定量估算","titleEn":"Soft-X-ray undulators and photon-energy coverage: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"],"prerequisiteIds":["a486-v12-25"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「U9、U5 與 EPU5.6 波盪器」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “U9, U5 and EPU5.6 undulators” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：波盪器基頻能量為 E₁[keV] = 0.950E²/(λu[cm](1 + K²/2))。U9 在 1.5 GeV、K = 1：E₁ = 0.950×2.25/(9×1.5) ≈ 158 eV；K = 3：≈ 43 eV；同一支 U9 在 3 GeV（K = 1）≈ 633 eV。若要以 1.5 GeV 在 K = 1 得到 10 keV 基頻，λu ≈ 0.950×2.25/(10×1.5) ≈ 0.14 cm，即 1.4 mm 週期，遠低於永久磁鐵波盪器的實用範圍。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: The undulator fundamental is E₁[keV] = 0.950E²/(λu[cm](1 + K²/2)). U9 at 1.5 GeV with K = 1 gives E₁ = 0.950×2.25/(9×1.5) ≈ 158 eV, and K = 3 gives ≈ 43 eV; the same U9 at 3 GeV (K = 1) gives ≈ 633 eV. A 10 keV fundamental at 1.5 GeV with K = 1 would need λu ≈ 0.950×2.25/(10×1.5) ≈ 0.14 cm, a 1.4 mm period, far below the practical range of permanent-magnet undulators. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：以光束線單色器掃描波盪器頻譜，量測基頻與高次諧波峰值能量對間隙的關係並與公式比較；EPU 改變相位時以偏振計量測圓偏振度；記錄間隙或相位改變時的軌道與工作點擾動，建立並定期更新前饋修正表。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Scan the undulator spectrum with the beamline monochromator and compare fundamental and harmonic peak energies versus gap with the formula; measure the degree of circular polarization with a polarimeter as the EPU phase changes; record orbit and tune disturbances as gap or phase changes to build and periodically refresh the feedforward table.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a486-v12-26-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"波盪器基頻能量為 E₁[keV] = 0.950E²/(λu[cm](1 + K²/2))。U9 在 1.5 GeV、K = 1：E₁ = 0.950×2.25/(9×1.5) ≈ 158 eV；K = 3：≈ 43 eV；同一支 U9 在 3 GeV（K = 1）≈ 633 eV。若要以 1.5 GeV 在 K = 1 得到 10 keV 基頻，λu ≈ 0.950×2.25/(10×1.5) ≈ 0.14 cm，即 1.4 mm 週期，遠低於永久磁鐵波盪器的實用範圍。","textEn":"The undulator fundamental is E₁[keV] = 0.950E²/(λu[cm](1 + K²/2)). U9 at 1.5 GeV with K = 1 gives E₁ = 0.950×2.25/(9×1.5) ≈ 158 eV, and K = 3 gives ≈ 43 eV; the same U9 at 3 GeV (K = 1) gives ≈ 633 eV. A 10 keV fundamental at 1.5 GeV with K = 1 would need λu ≈ 0.950×2.25/(10×1.5) ≈ 0.14 cm, a 1.4 mm period, far below the practical range of permanent-magnet undulators.","sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"]},{"id":"a486-v12-26-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「軟 X 光波盪器與光子能量涵蓋」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Soft-X-ray undulators and photon-energy coverage\", which statement holds?","options":["能量較低的 TLS，發射度一定比 3 GeV 的 TPS 小。","改用超導腔只是為了省電，對束流穩定性沒有幫助。","波盪器基頻能量為 E₁[keV] = 0.950E²/(λu[cm](1 + K²/2))。"],"optionsEn":["Because TLS has lower energy, its emittance must be smaller than that of 3 GeV TPS.","The switch to an SRF cavity was only about saving power, not beam stability.","The undulator fundamental is E₁[keV] = 0.950E²/(λu[cm](1 + K²/2))."],"answer":2,"explanation":"波盪器基頻能量為 E₁[keV] = 0.950E²/(λu[cm](1 + K²/2))。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"The undulator fundamental is E₁[keV] = 0.950E²/(λu[cm](1 + K²/2)). Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":26},{"id":"a486-v12-27","title":"軟 X 光波盪器與光子能量涵蓋：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Soft-X-ray undulators and photon-energy coverage: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"],"prerequisiteIds":["a486-v12-26"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「U9、U5 與 EPU5.6 波盪器」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “U9, U5 and EPU5.6 undulators” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"以光束線單色器掃描波盪器頻譜，量測基頻與高次諧波峰值能量對間隙的關係並與公式比較；EPU 改變相位時以偏振計量測圓偏振度；記錄間隙或相位改變時的軌道與工作點擾動，建立並定期更新前饋修正表。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Scan the undulator spectrum with the beamline monochromator and compare fundamental and harmonic peak energies versus gap with the formula; measure the degree of circular polarization with a polarimeter as the EPU phase changes; record orbit and tune disturbances as gap or phase changes to build and periodically refresh the feedforward table. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：波盪器磁鐵的相位誤差累積使高次諧波強度大幅下降，用戶在預期能量找不到足夠通量；EPU 切換偏振模式時若前饋表過期，軌道擾動傳到其他光束線，造成全環強度跳動。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Accumulated phase errors in the undulator magnets sharply weaken the higher harmonics, so users find too little flux at the expected energy; switching EPU polarization with an outdated feedforward table spreads orbit disturbances to other beamlines and makes intensity jump around the ring.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a486-v12-27-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以光束線單色器掃描波盪器頻譜，量測基頻與高次諧波峰值能量對間隙的關係並與公式比較；EPU 改變相位時以偏振計量測圓偏振度；記錄間隙或相位改變時的軌道與工作點擾動，建立並定期更新前饋修正表。","textEn":"Scan the undulator spectrum with the beamline monochromator and compare fundamental and harmonic peak energies versus gap with the formula; measure the degree of circular polarization with a polarimeter as the EPU phase changes; record orbit and tune disturbances as gap or phase changes to build and periodically refresh the feedforward table.","sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"]},{"id":"a486-v12-27-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「軟 X 光波盪器與光子能量涵蓋」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Soft-X-ray undulators and photon-energy coverage\"?","options":["以光束線單色器掃描波盪器頻譜，量測基頻與高次諧波峰值能量對間隙的關係並與公式比較。","量測時不必記錄溫度、振動與時間等條件，因為它們不會影響結果。","實施頂注以後，束流壽命就不再重要。"],"optionsEn":["Scan the undulator spectrum with the beamline monochromator and compare fundamental and harmonic peak energies versus gap with the formula.","Temperature, vibration and timing need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","With top-up running, beam lifetime no longer matters."],"answer":0,"explanation":"以光束線單色器掃描波盪器頻譜，量測基頻與高次諧波峰值能量對間隙的關係並與公式比較；EPU 改變相位時以偏振計量測圓偏振度；記錄間隙或相位改變時的軌道與工作點擾動，建立並定期更新前饋修正表。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Scan the undulator spectrum with the beamline monochromator and compare fundamental and harmonic peak energies versus gap with the formula; measure the degree of circular polarization with a polarimeter as the EPU phase changes; record orbit and tune disturbances as gap or phase changes to build and periodically refresh the feedforward table. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":27},{"id":"a486-v12-28","title":"軟 X 光波盪器與光子能量涵蓋：失效診斷","titleEn":"Soft-X-ray undulators and photon-energy coverage: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"],"prerequisiteIds":["a486-v12-27"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「U9、U5 與 EPU5.6 波盪器」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “U9, U5 and EPU5.6 undulators” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"波盪器磁鐵的相位誤差累積使高次諧波強度大幅下降，用戶在預期能量找不到足夠通量；EPU 切換偏振模式時若前饋表過期，軌道擾動傳到其他光束線，造成全環強度跳動。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Accumulated phase errors in the undulator magnets sharply weaken the higher harmonics, so users find too little flux at the expected energy; switching EPU polarization with an outdated feedforward table spreads orbit disturbances to other beamlines and makes intensity jump around the ring. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：因此 TLS 的光束線以軟 X 光、紅外與成熟的常規技術為主，與 TPS 的硬 X 光高亮度定位互補。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: TLS beamlines therefore focus on soft X-rays, infrared and mature routine techniques, complementing the hard-X-ray, high-brightness role of TPS.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「低能量環的波盪器也能輕易產生 10 keV 以上的基頻 X 光。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"An undulator on a low-energy ring can just as easily produce a fundamental above 10 keV.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a486-v12-28-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"波盪器磁鐵的相位誤差累積使高次諧波強度大幅下降，用戶在預期能量找不到足夠通量；EPU 切換偏振模式時若前饋表過期，軌道擾動傳到其他光束線，造成全環強度跳動。","textEn":"Accumulated phase errors in the undulator magnets sharply weaken the higher harmonics, so users find too little flux at the expected energy; switching EPU polarization with an outdated feedforward table spreads orbit disturbances to other beamlines and makes intensity jump around the ring.","sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"]},{"id":"a486-v12-28-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「軟 X 光波盪器與光子能量涵蓋」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Soft-X-ray undulators and photon-energy coverage\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自操作人員失誤，系統設計不需要檢討。","波盪器磁鐵的相位誤差累積使高次諧波強度大幅下降，用戶在預期能量找不到足夠通量；EPU 切換偏振模式時若前饋表過期，軌道擾動傳到其他光束線，造成全環強度跳動。","TPS 完工後 TLS 就失去用處，應該立即停機。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is operator error, so the system design never needs review.","Accumulated phase errors in the undulator magnets sharply weaken the higher harmonics, so users find too little flux at the expected energy.","Once TPS operated, TLS became useless and should have shut down at once."],"answer":1,"explanation":"波盪器磁鐵的相位誤差累積使高次諧波強度大幅下降，用戶在預期能量找不到足夠通量；EPU 切換偏振模式時若前饋表過期，軌道擾動傳到其他光束線，造成全環強度跳動。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Accumulated phase errors in the undulator magnets sharply weaken the higher harmonics, so users find too little flux at the expected energy; switching EPU polarization with an outdated feedforward table spreads orbit disturbances to other beamlines and makes intensity jump around the ring. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":28},{"id":"a486-v12-29","title":"與 TPS 並行運轉的分工、相干度與交接：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Running alongside TPS: division of labour, coherence and handoff: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"],"prerequisiteIds":["a486-v12-28"],"objective":"說明「TLS 與 TPS 的雙光源分工」如何決定台灣同步輻射光源 TLS的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Dual-source division between TLS and TPS” determines the key performance of “Taiwan Light Source”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"TPS 開放用戶後，TLS 並未退役，而是與 TPS 一起由 NSRRC 營運：TLS 提供 22 條光束線、約 50 個實驗站，偏重軟 X 光、紅外與成熟技術，TPS 承擔需要低發射度與高亮度的實驗。決定實驗留在哪座光源的工程依據之一是相干分率：當電子發射度遠大於光子繞射極限 λ/4π 時，相干光比例很低。交接需記錄每條光束線的光源參數、可用度與老化設備的維護計畫，避免兩座光源共用的人力、低溫與電力資源互相排擠。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「TLS 與 TPS 的雙光源分工」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"After TPS opened to users, TLS was not retired; NSRRC operates both: TLS provides 22 beamlines with about 50 end stations focused on soft X-rays, infrared and mature techniques, while TPS takes experiments needing low emittance and high brightness. One engineering criterion for which source hosts an experiment is the coherent fraction: when electron emittance far exceeds the photon diffraction limit λ/4π, little of the light is coherent. The handoff must record source parameters, availability and maintenance plans for ageing equipment on every beamline so that staff, cryogenics and electrical power shared by the two sources do not crowd each other out. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Dual-source division between TLS and TPS”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：繞射極限發射度 ε_r = λ/4π。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: The diffraction-limited emittance is ε_r = λ/4π.","failure":"常見誤解：「TPS 完工後 TLS 就失去用處，應該立即停機。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Once TPS operated, TLS became useless and should have shut down at once.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「TLS 與 TPS 的雙光源分工」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Dual-source division between TLS and TPS”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a486-v12-29-k1","title":"與 TPS 並行運轉的分工、相干度與交接","titleEn":"Running alongside TPS: division of labour, coherence and handoff","text":"TPS 開放用戶後，TLS 並未退役，而是與 TPS 一起由 NSRRC 營運：TLS 提供 22 條光束線、約 50 個實驗站，偏重軟 X 光、紅外與成熟技術，TPS 承擔需要低發射度與高亮度的實驗。決定實驗留在哪座光源的工程依據之一是相干分率：當電子發射度遠大於光子繞射極限 λ/4π 時，相干光比例很低。","textEn":"After TPS opened to users, TLS was not retired; NSRRC operates both: TLS provides 22 beamlines with about 50 end stations focused on soft X-rays, infrared and mature techniques, while TPS takes experiments needing low emittance and high brightness. One engineering criterion for which source hosts an experiment is the coherent fraction: when electron emittance far exceeds the photon diffraction limit λ/4π, little of the light is coherent.","sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"]},{"id":"a486-v12-29-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：TPS 完工後 TLS 就失去用處，應該立即停機。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Once TPS operated, TLS became useless and should have shut down at once. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「與 TPS 並行運轉的分工、相干度與交接」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Running alongside TPS: division of labour, coherence and handoff\" is correct?","options":["TPS 完工後 TLS 就失去用處，應該立即停機。","能量只提高 15%，同步輻射功率也只增加約 15%。","TPS 開放用戶後，TLS 並未退役，而是與 TPS 一起由 NSRRC 營運：TLS 提供 22 條光束線、約 50 個實驗站，偏重軟 X 光、紅外與成熟技術，TPS 承擔需要低發射度與高亮度的實驗。"],"optionsEn":["Once TPS operated, TLS became useless and should have shut down at once.","Raising energy by 15% raises synchrotron-radiation power by only about 15%.","After TPS opened to users, TLS was not retired."],"answer":2,"explanation":"TPS 開放用戶後，TLS 並未退役，而是與 TPS 一起由 NSRRC 營運：TLS 提供 22 條光束線、約 50 個實驗站，偏重軟 X 光、紅外與成熟技術，TPS 承擔需要低發射度與高亮度的實驗。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"After TPS opened to users, TLS was not retired; NSRRC operates both: TLS provides 22 beamlines with about 50 end stations focused on soft X-rays, infrared and mature techniques, while TPS takes experiments needing low emittance and high brightness. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":29},{"id":"a486-v12-30","title":"與 TPS 並行運轉的分工、相干度與交接：定量估算","titleEn":"Running alongside TPS: division of labour, coherence and handoff: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"],"prerequisiteIds":["a486-v12-29"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「TLS 與 TPS 的雙光源分工」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Dual-source division between TLS and TPS” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：繞射極限發射度 ε_r = λ/4π。100 eV（λ = 12.4 nm）：ε_r ≈ 0.99 nm；水平相干分率約 ε_r/(ε_x + ε_r)，TLS（25.6 nm）≈ 3.7%，TPS（1.6 nm）≈ 38%。10 keV（λ = 0.124 nm）：ε_r ≈ 9.9 pm，TLS ≈ 0.04%、TPS ≈ 0.6%。TLS 垂直發射度 88 pm 在 100 eV 已低於 ε_r，故軟 X 光在垂直方向接近全相干。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: The diffraction-limited emittance is ε_r = λ/4π. At 100 eV (λ = 12.4 nm), ε_r ≈ 0.99 nm and the horizontal coherent fraction is about ε_r/(ε_x + ε_r): TLS (25.6 nm) ≈ 3.7% and TPS (1.6 nm) ≈ 38%. At 10 keV (λ = 0.124 nm), ε_r ≈ 9.9 pm, TLS ≈ 0.04% and TPS ≈ 0.6%. The TLS vertical emittance of 88 pm is already below ε_r at 100 eV, so soft X-rays are nearly fully coherent vertically. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：每年以兩座光源的實際運轉參數（電流、發射度、可用度、故障停機時數）建立對照表；以光束線的狹縫干涉或空間相干量測驗證相干分率估算；把老化元件（電源、真空泵、低溫系統）的更換紀錄與故障率趨勢納入交接文件。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Each year tabulate the actual operating parameters of both sources (current, emittance, availability, fault downtime); verify coherent-fraction estimates with slit-interference or spatial-coherence measurements on beamlines; include replacement records and failure-rate trends of ageing components (power supplies, vacuum pumps, cryogenics) in the handoff documents.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a486-v12-30-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"繞射極限發射度 ε_r = λ/4π。100 eV（λ = 12.4 nm）：ε_r ≈ 0.99 nm；水平相干分率約 ε_r/(ε_x + ε_r)，TLS（25.6 nm）≈ 3.7%，TPS（1.6 nm）≈ 38%。10 keV（λ = 0.124 nm）：ε_r ≈ 9.9 pm，TLS ≈ 0.04%、TPS ≈ 0.6%。TLS 垂直發射度 88 pm 在 100 eV 已低於 ε_r，故軟 X 光在垂直方向接近全相干。","textEn":"The diffraction-limited emittance is ε_r = λ/4π. At 100 eV (λ = 12.4 nm), ε_r ≈ 0.99 nm and the horizontal coherent fraction is about ε_r/(ε_x + ε_r): TLS (25.6 nm) ≈ 3.7% and TPS (1.6 nm) ≈ 38%. At 10 keV (λ = 0.124 nm), ε_r ≈ 9.9 pm, TLS ≈ 0.04% and TPS ≈ 0.6%. The TLS vertical emittance of 88 pm is already below ε_r at 100 eV, so soft X-rays are nearly fully coherent vertically.","sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"]},{"id":"a486-v12-30-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「與 TPS 並行運轉的分工、相干度與交接」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Running alongside TPS: division of labour, coherence and handoff\", which statement holds?","options":["繞射極限發射度 ε_r = λ/4π。","超導扭擺器只是讓光變亮，對儲存環的束流動力學沒有影響。","實施頂注以後，束流壽命就不再重要。"],"optionsEn":["The diffraction-limited emittance is ε_r = λ/4π.","A superconducting wiggler only brightens the light and leaves ring beam dynamics untouched.","With top-up running, beam lifetime no longer matters."],"answer":0,"explanation":"繞射極限發射度 ε_r = λ/4π。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"The diffraction-limited emittance is ε_r = λ/4π. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":30},{"id":"a486-v12-31","title":"與 TPS 並行運轉的分工、相干度與交接：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Running alongside TPS: division of labour, coherence and handoff: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"],"prerequisiteIds":["a486-v12-30"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「TLS 與 TPS 的雙光源分工」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Dual-source division between TLS and TPS” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"每年以兩座光源的實際運轉參數（電流、發射度、可用度、故障停機時數）建立對照表；以光束線的狹縫干涉或空間相干量測驗證相干分率估算；把老化元件（電源、真空泵、低溫系統）的更換紀錄與故障率趨勢納入交接文件。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Each year tabulate the actual operating parameters of both sources (current, emittance, availability, fault downtime); verify coherent-fraction estimates with slit-interference or spatial-coherence measurements on beamlines; include replacement records and failure-rate trends of ageing components (power supplies, vacuum pumps, cryogenics) in the handoff documents. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：若把需要高相干度的實驗排到 TLS，只能用小孔徑濾出相干光，通量損失數十倍，實驗時間膨脹；若 TLS 的維護因資源轉向 TPS 而延後，老化電源與真空設備的故障率上升，22 條光束線的可用度一起下降。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Scheduling a coherence-hungry experiment on TLS forces small apertures to filter coherent light, losing tens of times in flux and inflating beam time; deferring TLS maintenance as resources shift to TPS raises failure rates of ageing power supplies and vacuum equipment, and availability drops across all 22 beamlines.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a486-v12-31-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"每年以兩座光源的實際運轉參數（電流、發射度、可用度、故障停機時數）建立對照表；以光束線的狹縫干涉或空間相干量測驗證相干分率估算；把老化元件（電源、真空泵、低溫系統）的更換紀錄與故障率趨勢納入交接文件。","textEn":"Each year tabulate the actual operating parameters of both sources (current, emittance, availability, fault downtime); verify coherent-fraction estimates with slit-interference or spatial-coherence measurements on beamlines; include replacement records and failure-rate trends of ageing components (power supplies, vacuum pumps, cryogenics) in the handoff documents.","sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"]},{"id":"a486-v12-31-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「與 TPS 並行運轉的分工、相干度與交接」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Running alongside TPS: division of labour, coherence and handoff\"?","options":["沿用另一台設備或另一個案例的量測結果，就可視為本系統已完成驗證。","每年以兩座光源的實際運轉參數（電流、發射度、可用度、故障停機時數）建立對照表。","軌道回授可以補償任何地面變形，因此不必監測地層。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another instrument or another case counts as verifying this system.","Each year tabulate the actual operating parameters of both sources (current, emittance, availability, fault downtime).","Orbit feedback compensates any ground motion, so ground monitoring is unnecessary."],"answer":1,"explanation":"每年以兩座光源的實際運轉參數（電流、發射度、可用度、故障停機時數）建立對照表；以光束線的狹縫干涉或空間相干量測驗證相干分率估算；把老化元件（電源、真空泵、低溫系統）的更換紀錄與故障率趨勢納入交接文件。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Each year tabulate the actual operating parameters of both sources (current, emittance, availability, fault downtime); verify coherent-fraction estimates with slit-interference or spatial-coherence measurements on beamlines; include replacement records and failure-rate trends of ageing components (power supplies, vacuum pumps, cryogenics) in the handoff documents. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":31},{"id":"a486-v12-32","title":"與 TPS 並行運轉的分工、相干度與交接：失效診斷","titleEn":"Running alongside TPS: division of labour, coherence and handoff: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"],"prerequisiteIds":["a486-v12-31"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「TLS 與 TPS 的雙光源分工」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Dual-source division between TLS and TPS” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"若把需要高相干度的實驗排到 TLS，只能用小孔徑濾出相干光，通量損失數十倍，實驗時間膨脹；若 TLS 的維護因資源轉向 TPS 而延後，老化電源與真空設備的故障率上升，22 條光束線的可用度一起下降。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Scheduling a coherence-hungry experiment on TLS forces small apertures to filter coherent light, losing tens of times in flux and inflating beam time; deferring TLS maintenance as resources shift to TPS raises failure rates of ageing power supplies and vacuum equipment, and availability drops across all 22 beamlines. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：交接需記錄每條光束線的光源參數、可用度與老化設備的維護計畫，避免兩座光源共用的人力、低溫與電力資源互相排擠。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The handoff must record source parameters, availability and maintenance plans for ageing equipment on every beamline so that staff, cryogenics and electrical power shared by the two sources do not crowd each other out.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「TPS 完工後 TLS 就失去用處，應該立即停機。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Once TPS operated, TLS became useless and should have shut down at once.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a486-v12-32-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"若把需要高相干度的實驗排到 TLS，只能用小孔徑濾出相干光，通量損失數十倍，實驗時間膨脹；若 TLS 的維護因資源轉向 TPS 而延後，老化電源與真空設備的故障率上升，22 條光束線的可用度一起下降。","textEn":"Scheduling a coherence-hungry experiment on TLS forces small apertures to filter coherent light, losing tens of times in flux and inflating beam time; deferring TLS maintenance as resources shift to TPS raises failure rates of ageing power supplies and vacuum equipment, and availability drops across all 22 beamlines.","sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"]},{"id":"a486-v12-32-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「與 TPS 並行運轉的分工、相干度與交接」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Running alongside TPS: division of labour, coherence and handoff\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["調高增益或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數異常。","能量只提高 15%，同步輻射功率也只增加約 15%。","若把需要高相干度的實驗排到 TLS，只能用小孔徑濾出相干光，通量損失數十倍，實驗時間膨脹。"],"optionsEn":["Raising the gain or widening the acceptance limits solves most anomalies.","Raising energy by 15% raises synchrotron-radiation power by only about 15%.","Scheduling a coherence-hungry experiment on TLS forces small apertures to filter coherent light, losing tens of times in flux and inflating beam time."],"answer":2,"explanation":"若把需要高相干度的實驗排到 TLS，只能用小孔徑濾出相干光，通量損失數十倍，實驗時間膨脹；若 TLS 的維護因資源轉向 TPS 而延後，老化電源與真空設備的故障率上升，22 條光束線的可用度一起下降。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Scheduling a coherence-hungry experiment on TLS forces small apertures to filter coherent light, losing tens of times in flux and inflating beam time; deferring TLS maintenance as resources shift to TPS raises failure rates of ageing power supplies and vacuum equipment, and availability drops across all 22 beamlines. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":32}],"order":4}],"sourceIds":["v12o-srrc-status-pac1993","v12o-tls-swls-epac2000","v12o-tls-iasw-epac2006","v12o-tls-status-apac2007"],"curriculumVersion":12,"stepCount":32,"estimatedMinutes":800}};
